{"id":"a475edd1-73fe-4b65-a723-c6d0e0e22fd1","expr":"result.size() == (namespaceMappings != null ? namespaceMappings.size() : 0)","rationale":"The size of the result list matches the size of the input map.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getNamespaces(Map<String, String>):List<Namespace>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.930728087Z"}
{"id":"ad24b9b6-3f1f-4760-b056-a447392ecab3","expr":"(!result.isEmpty()) == (namespaceMappings != null && !namespaceMappings.isEmpty())","rationale":"Result is non-empty if and only if namespaceMappings is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getNamespaces(Map<String, String>):List<Namespace>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.930728087Z"}
{"id":"615a4bed-a62d-4352-bf93-03416dfe1ad7","expr":"attributes != null","rationale":"To safely call methods on attributes, it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.937919201Z"}
{"id":"19cced8e-1298-4539-b582-237e9c3ace37","expr":"attributes.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"The number of attributes reported should never be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.937919201Z"}
{"id":"0b48a8cd-732f-450b-b864-01453102eaf9","expr":"attributes.getLength() == attributes.getLength()","rationale":"This is trivial and should be omitted.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.937919201Z"}
{"id":"3f527543-b623-4600-8865-79e22329bf89","expr":"!attributes.getQName(0).isEmpty() || attributes.getLength() == 0","rationale":"This reflects a relationship between the attribute length and its QName.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.937919201Z"}
{"id":"899ba230-7d3e-4023-8567-96217d62c4a6","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always initializes and returns a non-null List.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.939692256Z"}
{"id":"cd61cbef-bb4b-487c-819f-59c51f813c16","expr":"result.size() <= attributes.getLength()","rationale":"For each attribute in 'attributes', at most one corresponding Attribute is added to result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.939692256Z"}
{"id":"6e355f61-8d89-481d-baa7-ace98193b18a","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || attributes.getLength() == 0","rationale":"If attributes has length zero, result is empty, otherwise may contain elements.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getAttributes(Attributes):List<Attribute>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.939692256Z"}
{"id":"1eb171fe-d2b7-4e12-9077-6f82bc7e9e40","expr":"name != null","rationale":"name must be non-null because it is passed to createEndElement which requires a QName.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.944606686Z"}
{"id":"87cca56f-04ad-4a87-8333-2958512f3274","expr":"namespaceMapping != null","rationale":"namespaceMapping must be non-null because getNamespaces is invoked with it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.944606686Z"}
{"id":"089ba2d1-9381-4193-a258-fefeccb61fc1","expr":"name.getLocalPart() != null","rationale":"QName's local part is expected not to be null for valid qualified names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.944606686Z"}
{"id":"6dcb7d9f-5bc0-493d-a68c-d7d5ace00bb7","expr":"namespaceMapping != null && !namespaceMapping.isEmpty()","rationale":"At method exit, namespaceMapping is expected to be non-null and not empty as used to call getNamespaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.946084844Z"}
{"id":"80c52d12-9251-41f1-886b-31c0d2acbfd6","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The QName name parameter should be non-null for this method to complete normally.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.946084844Z"}
{"id":"b71650a8-a564-4930-ab12-4fa5f9985284","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The method calls createCharacters(data), which likely requires data to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.950834203Z"}
{"id":"9c64e187-9ca0-4fe7-93c0-62ff44d616a6","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"Since data is a String, its length property must be at least 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.950834203Z"}
{"id":"9963643f-2d4a-4b1a-b302-71d0ab9578a7","expr":"data.isEmpty() || data.length() > 0","rationale":"Covers the logical partition of data being empty or not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.950834203Z"}
{"id":"5fc58de6-81b0-4e67-889b-3c6f5243dbe7","expr":"data.indexOf('\\0') == -1","rationale":"In XML context, null characters are generally not allowed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.950834203Z"}
{"id":"57ecf797-f952-4de0-9b1d-760a88b01091","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Since data is directly passed to createCharacters method, it is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.955560187Z"}
{"id":"55e9b0cd-164d-4408-9961-15dd143470d3","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"data is a String and thus its length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.955560187Z"}
{"id":"b527e52c-8926-43df-9356-ddcdac2030b2","expr":"data.equals(data.trim()) || data.trim().length() < data.length()","rationale":"character data can include leading or trailing whitespace or not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.955560187Z"}
{"id":"93c6c574-31ae-4cf9-9515-e1e8b4f9f99e","expr":"data != null && !data.isEmpty() || data.isEmpty()","rationale":"data can be empty or not empty; this invariant is trivial but included for completeness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#charactersInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.955560187Z"}
{"id":"75ec0072-95c0-43e6-9f13-27731486397b","expr":"data != null && !data.contains(\"]]>\")","rationale":"CDATA content should not include ']]>' to maintain valid XML.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.956737989Z"}
{"id":"413ff0dc-0a04-4d91-8782-569b943dff86","expr":"data != null && !data.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method likely expects non-empty data string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.956737989Z"}
{"id":"4ade9e7a-9c2b-42f5-95da-6846acd6a824","expr":"data != null && data.indexOf('<') >= 0 || data.indexOf('&') >= 0","rationale":"Data likely contains characters that require CDATA encapsulation to avoid XML escaping.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.956737989Z"}
{"id":"73f1551a-5d1f-4a6d-b4bd-8c56cae91dc3","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Since data is passed to createCData, it is expected to be non-null for the method to work correctly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.962118739Z"}
{"id":"b0e1432a-87f8-48bb-a8f4-2710c864533b","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"Basic invariant that string length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.962118739Z"}
{"id":"a9549337-66d4-44eb-b5e4-fe2311c56fae","expr":"data != null","rationale":"To safely create an ignorable space event from data, the data string should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.962435827Z"}
{"id":"8ffbb771-9a6b-49ee-89a7-7cf5b88c7107","expr":"data.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"CDATA content is usually non-empty after trimming whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.962118739Z"}
{"id":"5573c745-4150-46f2-a29f-222ac148bed7","expr":"data.trim().isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method is ignorableWhitespaceInternal, the input string likely contains only whitespace, so trimming it results in empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.962435827Z"}
{"id":"23190167-1c59-4bf1-9d73-02028438229b","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The data parameter must be non-null because it is passed directly to createIgnorableSpace without checks.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.970213769Z"}
{"id":"4a0f39c0-18a1-44b1-a888-9744bd9a8af4","expr":"data.length() > 0","rationale":"It is expected that ignorable whitespace has length greater than zero at this point since it was processed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.970213769Z"}
{"id":"5386a261-723f-45a1-a5b0-3acf026eb460","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The method creates a processing instruction using target, so target is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.970627229Z"}
{"id":"8ce80650-ed65-4ec4-a4f3-bea4037c448f","expr":"data == null || !data.contains(\"?>\")","rationale":"As data becomes the content of the processing instruction, it should not contain '?>' which ends the instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.970627229Z"}
{"id":"124eb0fe-86e8-4e70-a441-14572a5c6de1","expr":"target.length() > 0","rationale":"For a processing instruction, target must be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.970627229Z"}
{"id":"20b4d19f-8c22-4673-a27d-915425feb866","expr":"data == null || data.length() >= 0","rationale":"data can be null or a string of any length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.970627229Z"}
{"id":"4ab3c4c6-ceb7-4033-8d82-6f4b019acbcd","expr":"!target.contains(\"<?\")","rationale":"The target string should not contain '<?' which denotes start of XML processing instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.970627229Z"}
{"id":"510f6b8b-5b9d-46bb-b159-a0b2770141b4","expr":"target != null && !target.isEmpty()","rationale":"The target string is typically required to identify the processing instruction and should be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.976196354Z"}
{"id":"90bc96c1-ffaf-40ba-9190-7504a8e6ec73","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The data string can be empty but is generally non-null to avoid creating invalid processing instructions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.976196354Z"}
{"id":"75f85aab-fd08-4610-b39e-9a84494ed68f","expr":"target.length() <= 1000","rationale":"Targets are usually short strings, and imposing an upper bound can reflect typical usage.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.976196354Z"}
{"id":"68d97dc4-e48d-41f3-a158-c15105625d14","expr":"dtd != null","rationale":"The method creates a DTD event with dtd as input; dtd must be non-null for createDTD to succeed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.976842002Z"}
{"id":"6e5cef5f-9199-4aec-8a65-692e51b3da4e","expr":"dtd.length() >= 0","rationale":"The input string length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.976842002Z"}
{"id":"87086598-a9e4-4148-8d8b-67cb86d1555a","expr":"dtd != null","rationale":"The method creates a DTD event using dtd string and adds it to eventWriter, so dtd must be a valid non-null XML DTD string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.986575281Z"}
{"id":"fc626d5a-0116-408f-9f0d-2ba2f51b38ca","expr":"dtd.contains(\"[\") == dtd.contains(\"]\")","rationale":"An internal subset DTD syntax uses square brackets, so if one bracket exists, the other should as well for well-formedness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.986575281Z"}
{"id":"3c71fc68-2d30-4dc3-b29a-96122032659a","expr":"dtd.length() > 0","rationale":"An empty string does not form a valid DTD; thus the string should have length greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.986575281Z"}
{"id":"76cbd489-7be8-4bdd-999d-42264197a206","expr":"!dtd.contains(\"<?\")","rationale":"Processing instructions are a separate XML construct and unlikely part of a DTD content string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.986575281Z"}
{"id":"8c3e8748-3b03-4238-9f27-655e22c24416","expr":"comment != null","rationale":"To create a valid XML comment, the comment string should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.987249634Z"}
{"id":"1f1a2e98-4935-485c-a2f5-43b582807449","expr":"comment.indexOf(\"--\") == -1","rationale":"The string used for an XML comment should not contain the sequence \"--\" as it is invalid in XML comments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.987249634Z"}
{"id":"20d01da5-5ea1-40d0-a8ac-96ef270430c9","expr":"comment.length() >= 0","rationale":"By definition, string length is never negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.987249634Z"}
{"id":"80548859-8ed9-4a3d-8755-41dc174749d3","expr":"!comment.endsWith(\"-\")","rationale":"To prevent invalid XML comment termination that might interfere with comment syntax.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.987249634Z"}
{"id":"e563746e-af6f-47c8-a1d7-c3ca2249b1ef","expr":"!comment.startsWith(\"-\")","rationale":"To comply with XML comment specification that doesn't allow starting with hyphen.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.987249634Z"}
{"id":"fb667b99-0f81-47e5-8e38-bc5805b1233e","expr":"comment != null","rationale":"The method uses 'comment' to create a comment event, so 'comment' should be a valid non-null string at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.995750288Z"}
{"id":"272c3ca9-8a2c-4655-997c-2caf3e6fbdc7","expr":"comment.trim().length() >= 0","rationale":"String length of trimmed comment is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.995750288Z"}
{"id":"d4278419-e8fc-425f-94f5-65b6ffc9ce1a","expr":"!comment.contains(\"--\")","rationale":"XML comments cannot contain double hyphens '--', so comment shouldn't include that.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.995750288Z"}
{"id":"c126e359-ae8d-41d6-ad14-16bb9b4ecee3","expr":"!comment.startsWith(\"-\") && !comment.endsWith(\"-\")","rationale":"XML comment syntax forbids starting or ending with a hyphen, enforced by the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:12:41.995750288Z"}
