{"id":"944393a4-9cf8-4a96-993a-0f14046fe69a","expr":"uri != null","rationale":"The uri is used as a value in a map, it is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.430554793Z"}
{"id":"3e0ef0cf-48db-48c4-a358-d354d576deb8","expr":"!prefix.isEmpty()","rationale":"Namespace prefix usually is not empty in XML context.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.430554793Z"}
{"id":"03469c91-5696-485d-bef7-d9cddc0ffe01","expr":"!uri.isEmpty()","rationale":"Namespace uri is usually a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.430554793Z"}
{"id":"f677420d-2015-4974-9d1e-da799196cdff","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.length() >= 0","rationale":"If prefix is not null, its length is at least zero","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.436068654Z"}
{"id":"483596f8-91b4-4e4e-b7a7-d5d5d76cd866","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.trim().length() >= 0","rationale":"If prefix is not null, trimming it results in a string with length at least zero","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.436068654Z"}
{"id":"8e3ce40b-e271-4ca8-982d-2d05168be111","expr":"qName != null","rationale":"startElement is usually called with qName being non-null as it's the qualified XML name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.446271579Z"}
{"id":"2c907d6b-9779-487d-b6cf-e32f2e585fd9","expr":"(uri == null) || qName.startsWith(uri)","rationale":"If the namespace URI is present, qName often starts with it or incorporates it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.446271579Z"}
{"id":"f59e60c5-1b1f-474d-b4ef-9dce3bc562fe","expr":"localName != null","rationale":"Local name in XML parsing is required and typically non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.446271579Z"}
{"id":"03fd1394-e7d2-4eab-b684-b44fc896bd8f","expr":"atts != null","rationale":"Attributes parameter is likely always non-null to represent attribute list.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.446271579Z"}
{"id":"be01b3c3-e793-418f-8eed-b226525ba611","expr":"atts.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"Attributes length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.446271579Z"}
{"id":"7974ec1a-8d8e-41bf-857a-3b117fa18c8c","expr":"qName != null && !qName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The qName parameter is expected to be a valid XML qualified name, therefore non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.452207537Z"}
{"id":"d4cb3930-ecdf-4bfb-9076-5a797263170b","expr":"uri != null","rationale":"The uri parameter representing the namespace URI should not be null after method processing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.452207537Z"}
{"id":"39ea622b-9764-4ebf-b700-945082b63b19","expr":"localName != null && !localName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The localName parameter should be non-null and non-empty as it identifies the element's local name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.452207537Z"}
{"id":"8577d1f3-9651-40e0-b7ab-c572711cab1b","expr":"atts != null","rationale":"The atts parameter should be a valid Attributes object, not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.452207537Z"}
{"id":"7d87f61b-ecc5-49e8-a350-483d91601dc5","expr":"atts.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"The atts object represents the attributes of the element and getLength returns the count, which should not be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.452207537Z"}
{"id":"a4b611c8-2cef-4231-bd70-816ed8c735cf","expr":"uri != null || (localName != null && qName != null)","rationale":"Either uri is provided, or both localName and qName are provided, to identify the element.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.458505787Z"}
{"id":"b2bf9c47-6f27-42e2-a7ff-97b19fd75e72","expr":"(qName == null) || qName.length() > 0","rationale":"If qName is provided, it is not empty, representing a qualified XML name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.458505787Z"}
{"id":"55f7eb93-67c9-42d0-900a-555672b3514a","expr":"(localName == null) || localName.length() >= 0","rationale":"localName is a string representing the local part of the element name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.458505787Z"}
{"id":"ec9f175f-9599-43a3-b257-ad56c051881d","expr":"uri == null || uri.length() >= 0","rationale":"uri is a namespace URI string, can be null or non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.458505787Z"}
{"id":"3ac0b629-6e7f-4f14-a7ce-fe88827d07d1","expr":"(localName != null || qName != null)","rationale":"To identify the element, either localName or qName should be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.458505787Z"}
{"id":"d398ff79-9110-4aa7-952a-837fd525137a","expr":"uri != null && (qName == null || qName.contains(localName))","rationale":"Qualified name 'qName' typically includes the namespace prefix followed by ':' and then the localName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.464860413Z"}
{"id":"d9e8b0f3-93e5-4f17-9bc2-053db7131be6","expr":"localName != null && !localName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Because endElement is called on a specific element, localName is expected to be a meaningful non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.464860413Z"}
{"id":"af94be44-bb12-4d79-936a-c06bcc154b75","expr":"(qName == null || !qName.isEmpty())","rationale":"qName should not be an empty string, since it represents the qualified name of element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.464860413Z"}
{"id":"dbc86d5d-90d7-470c-ac89-1aa34119e980","expr":"uri != null || (localName != null && qName != null)","rationale":"This captures that either the namespace URI exists or both localName and qName do, assuming namespace awareness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.464860413Z"}
{"id":"22c08580-4a9f-4da0-8a1d-04ab9bf5fb5b","expr":"qName == null || qName.startsWith(uri) || !uri.isEmpty()","rationale":"Ensures consistent relationship between uri and qName's prefix (though not guaranteed in all contexts)","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.464860413Z"}
{"id":"6dbf93c0-cf6f-4c8c-a25f-6b1fa1b3f503","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The input character array must be non-null because the String constructor called with (char[], int, int) throws NullPointerException if ch is null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.471255777Z"}
{"id":"4bb45f38-5656-4224-b426-2a4b4ea0502d","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"The start index must be non-negative as it is used by the String constructor to indicate the starting index in the character array","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.471255777Z"}
{"id":"9f4ae1d0-a804-442c-81f6-834ee9e6a6f5","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"The length parameter must be non-negative because it is the count of characters to use from the char array to create the string","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.471255777Z"}
{"id":"741935e8-c013-4411-a41b-94912465422f","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The sum of start and length must be <= ch.length for the constructor new String(ch, start, length) to be valid and not raise an IndexOutOfBoundsException","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.471255777Z"}
{"id":"7ed0f6d9-2c3c-4dfb-865f-9a5909aef9a8","expr":"length == 0 || start < ch.length","rationale":"If length is positive then start must be less than array length otherwise the substring is invalid","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.471255777Z"}
{"id":"aaad1c1f-2d4d-414e-b29b-3b9849339d5a","expr":"ch != null && start >= 0 && length >= 0 && start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"Safe construction of the String from the char array with given start and length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.477560249Z"}
{"id":"3d2d518c-6c0a-402a-805d-752e0825c754","expr":"length == 0 || ch.length > 0","rationale":"If 'length' is positive, 'ch' must contain characters to extract from.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.477560249Z"}
{"id":"63b6f91c-e92d-4274-9876-16fd6757351c","expr":"start <= ch.length","rationale":"Ensuring start index is within char array bounds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.477560249Z"}
{"id":"50045f4e-38fa-40ba-a167-ce96f3a8b8aa","expr":"length <= ch.length","rationale":"Logical bound check for length relative to the char array size.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.477560249Z"}
{"id":"60ff5205-3959-4898-a06f-3fb1c7a26f4c","expr":"start + length >= 0","rationale":"Ensures the parameters to String constructor are non-negative and valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.477560249Z"}
{"id":"0972449f-c235-4801-b638-c9b669a87b24","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The array 'ch' must be non-null to create a new String from it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.483779140Z"}
{"id":"1dbe5ed7-b3c7-4409-adaa-81435796725f","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"'start' must be zero or positive to be a valid index into the array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.483779140Z"}
{"id":"a2c86671-e2d2-4451-a272-4ff1a1a629e9","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"'length' must be zero or positive for the substring length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.483779140Z"}
{"id":"204b0059-e5f9-4118-b448-c98a1cd72f37","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The substring from 'start' to 'start + length' must fit inside 'ch' array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.483779140Z"}
{"id":"fdd92fa7-f8ea-4805-b0e3-626ad9ac86de","expr":"start >= 0 && length >= 0","rationale":"start and length are used to create a substring from the char array, so both must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.489891009Z"}
{"id":"4ff4a66a-468a-482e-bb1b-7f801b936ba5","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The constructor String(ch, start, length) requires ch to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.489891009Z"}
{"id":"bd6ae01b-0153-4a33-9da2-39b1e1f7509e","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"To safely create new String(ch, start, length), the boundaries must be inside ch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.489891009Z"}
{"id":"e4ba9486-12ef-4682-94c4-1bac3f1c8f1f","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The processingInstructionInternal method likely requires a non-null target to identify the target of the processing instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.495848526Z"}
{"id":"0105a12d-7dfe-4dc4-a395-b5f0442ab694","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Since data is passed to processingInstructionInternal, it is plausible that data must be at least a valid string, possibly empty but not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.495848526Z"}
{"id":"46b8cadd-108b-4b5a-a71e-e945d967986c","expr":"target.length() > 0","rationale":"Processing instructions generally have a non-empty target to specify the instruction name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.495848526Z"}
{"id":"f1f23344-c2f0-40a1-9dd8-a31e282120c4","expr":"!target.contains(\"<?\")","rationale":"The target string should not contain processing instruction start delimiters which might be invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.495848526Z"}
{"id":"83d2c20e-acb6-46db-80b2-3949fd9c185f","expr":"data.isEmpty() || data != null","rationale":"Since data is a string parameter, it might be empty or non-null when passed to the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.495848526Z"}
{"id":"794d3196-8eab-466e-941c-95e2247aebe6","expr":"target != null && data != null || target == null || data == null","rationale":"method is called with target and data; the exceptions thrown indicate that the method likely expects target and data to be passed along","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.502265060Z"}
{"id":"d4c63d4a-5e86-46d8-9173-9d85aaef25bb","expr":"target != null && !target.isEmpty() || target == null || target.isEmpty()","rationale":"target is expected to be a non-empty processing instruction target string or possibly empty but still processed","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.502265060Z"}
{"id":"c5d1cad4-1738-476c-afa9-1d68bf7fdcb5","expr":"data != null && data.length() >= 0","rationale":"data is a string and length is non-negative if data is non-null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.502265060Z"}
{"id":"c1978d9b-3d33-407b-b5d1-1946e1d4d105","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method uses 'name' in a method call 'skippedEntityInternal(name)', so nullness is relevant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.508065191Z"}
{"id":"bfd2b728-29f1-4798-8cfc-cc927f452df7","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Entity names in XML are usually non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.508065191Z"}
{"id":"76a56505-b6b4-4494-8647-0ac8f3e0d032","expr":"!name.contains(\" \")","rationale":"XML entity names typically are tokens without whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.508065191Z"}
{"id":"2ad453ba-7d29-4dcd-9549-9385babcf178","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0","rationale":"The skippedEntity method is only meaningful if name is non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.514068124Z"}
{"id":"104614fb-dc24-4b3f-8881-ba48cdaa5d6e","expr":"name == null || name.indexOf(' ') == -1","rationale":"XML entity names do not contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.514068124Z"}
{"id":"134a8fd0-e1b6-419e-9d43-565322b2e4f4","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is used unconditionally to build the DOCTYPE string, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.519944759Z"}
{"id":"dcda06ec-21b9-43fe-820a-c485cd3950a9","expr":"systemId != null","rationale":"In the method, systemId is appended without null guards, so it's expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.519944759Z"}
{"id":"c66d42cc-7516-4f6d-ad06-5d2e1f970dc4","expr":"(publicId == null) || (publicId.length() > 0)","rationale":"If publicId is provided, it is used meaningfully, so if not null, it is presumably non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.519944759Z"}
{"id":"70b5ea39-5bd6-41af-a488-2a021cd8b9ee","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"As 'name' is used in constructing DOCTYPE, it should have a positive length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.519944759Z"}
{"id":"77d00a7f-ea26-431b-ada6-33cbb31e547f","expr":"systemId.length() > 0","rationale":"The systemId string is appended directly; presumably it's non-empty for a valid DOCTYPE.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.519944759Z"}
{"id":"80878722-487a-4903-ba9e-e652cfb2a67d","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0","rationale":"Based on the method appending name to the DOCTYPE, name must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.526692498Z"}
{"id":"4dbebd63-bc40-4a44-bc2c-19aa31ba2590","expr":"(publicId != null) || (systemId != null && systemId.length() > 0)","rationale":"SystemId is appended either after 'PUBLIC' if publicId is present or after 'SYSTEM' otherwise, implying systemId is always non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.526692498Z"}
{"id":"f6041639-ed19-4345-af98-4f958cf27a7f","expr":"systemId != null && systemId.length() > 0","rationale":"The method appends systemId in both branches implying systemId must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.526692498Z"}
{"id":"1b503c78-0d6d-486d-b581-ac9c457ab580","expr":"publicId == null || (publicId.length() > 0)","rationale":"The code appends 'PUBLIC \"' + publicId + '\" \"', so if publicId is not null, it likely is non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.526692498Z"}
{"id":"eef30643-59c4-45f3-bf63-1f77a73d5e35","expr":"!(publicId != null && systemId == null)","rationale":"When publicId is non-null, systemId must also be non-null to produce a well-formed DOCTYPE declaration.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.526692498Z"}
{"id":"f1633e63-966c-4504-b6d1-ac4dfd6ddfeb","expr":"ch != null  &&  start >= 0  &&  length >= 0  &&  start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The constructor new String(char[] value, int offset, int count) requires that offset and count specify a valid range within the array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.556056627Z"}
{"id":"2a59e87e-179a-47bf-894a-bad9b1a63c23","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"Length describes how many characters from ch starting at start are used. Negative length would be invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.556056627Z"}
{"id":"428b1ad3-7a63-45f8-915a-ccf3b1f0e3f2","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"Java array indexing requires start index to be at least 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.556056627Z"}
{"id":"effc3568-c4ec-4a55-aca0-12d6325fb5a6","expr":"start <= ch.length","rationale":"Start index must be within or at most equal to ch length to avoid IndexOutOfBounds.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.556056627Z"}
{"id":"4aebad54-6030-44aa-944b-f3e63ff895de","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"Creating a new String with the given char array requires that the array is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.558847311Z"}
{"id":"18e95a9c-df26-41a1-bc74-f1ed6f78515c","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"The start index for substring extraction must be within valid array bounds, starting from zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.558847311Z"}
{"id":"73760149-377e-451e-9697-bbf769e080cb","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"Length passed to String constructor must be non-negative to avoid exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.558847311Z"}
{"id":"50c04a81-6312-4e2f-b4bc-0ef7af5dadfd","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The substring defined by start and length must fit entirely within the bounds of the char array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.558847311Z"}
{"id":"3399080d-3358-43bf-9d70-e83585b4e3d6","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method logically expects 'name' parameter to identify the entity starting.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.563208097Z"}
