{"id":"5772749f-a2d6-44ec-8c51-9c2686977264","expr":"name.trim().length() == name.length()","rationale":"Leading or trailing spaces in name are generally disallowed or unintended.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.563208097Z"}
{"id":"a3ebceb8-37a3-48bb-bb6a-79738d0d28a8","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter should be non-null after the method starts processing an entity.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.564703798Z"}
{"id":"585c3bc1-80c7-4db6-a92f-d31347a293ac","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name parameter represents the entity name to end; it is expected to be non-null to identify the entity.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.569599854Z"}
{"id":"8f3b85e5-f785-41fb-9b72-d31a8e39d307","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"An entity name having length greater than zero makes sense semantically for XML entity naming.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.569599854Z"}
{"id":"c7d9d37b-c08d-4cf3-9e3c-941254f9fe9f","expr":"!name.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Entity names in XML do not generally contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.569599854Z"}
{"id":"8e0267e5-d11d-46b0-a354-927eb323b8e6","expr":"name.equals(name.trim())","rationale":"It is expected that entity names are trimmed and do not have excess whitespace around.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:02.569599854Z"}
