{"id":"76802751-c004-4ff4-954e-00306e3bbf7e","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method assumes name can be safely compared with a string literal, so it is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#getProperty(String):Object","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:03.173118493Z"}
{"id":"f5278d89-44ef-46a9-b538-973836457744","expr":"name.length() >= 0","rationale":"Any non-null string has length >= 0, so this is always true.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#getProperty(String):Object","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:13:03.173118493Z"}
