{"id":"28070a41-e569-46b2-be3c-a6ecc0c281ba","expr":"result.endsWith(\".class\")","rationale":"The method appends CLASS_FILE_SUFFIX ('.class') to the substring to form the result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:06.948708766Z"}
{"id":"9a41f085-2d34-4b85-b425-3509f1da4f62","expr":"result.length() > 6","rationale":"Since result is substring plus \".class\", it must be longer than just the suffix length 6.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:06.948708766Z"}
{"id":"d8d2918f-b7fd-4412-af55-152766073683","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getSimpleName() + \".class\")","rationale":"The last part of the class name matches clazz.getSimpleName(), so result equals simple name + \".class\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:06.948708766Z"}
{"id":"410e810d-0807-4ac1-b2da-2a7d4984ae0c","expr":"result.charAt(0) == clazz.getSimpleName().charAt(0)","rationale":"The result is derived from the simple name of clazz, so initial characters match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:06.948708766Z"}
{"id":"5f12086d-dc54-428c-b4cb-40443a01aea7","expr":"!result || clazz != null","rationale":"Method returns false if clazz is null, so result true implies clazz non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:07.606005848Z"}
{"id":"98988772-7e91-4529-8bfd-985887ce130a","expr":"!result || clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"Since clazz is non-null and getName() returns non-null string, this holds for true result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:07.606005848Z"}
{"id":"042a269f-4a8b-4c70-ae0d-97bfe840ef49","expr":"instance != null","rationale":"The method immediately asserts that instance is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:07.933206467Z"}
{"id":"1da0ee05-24c0-4609-8d0a-f113861ee1c5","expr":"instance.getClass() != null","rationale":"All non-null objects have a non-null class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:07.933206467Z"}
{"id":"3df20ac2-97f3-4c43-b7a9-c84560f90da7","expr":"instance.getClass().isAssignableFrom(instance.getClass())","rationale":"A class is always assignable from itself, useful baseline.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:07.933206467Z"}
{"id":"54ef2e71-f673-450b-8f7a-3e0cd8eaa956","expr":"fqClassName != null","rationale":"Method asserts fqClassName must not be null, so this holds before method execution.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:07.994505324Z"}
{"id":"62335425-be33-47ad-9344-705bbbc7673a","expr":"fqClassName.contains(\".\") || fqClassName.indexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"To compute package name, we rely on position of '.', so invariant reflects its presence or absence.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:07.994505324Z"}
{"id":"73e03a1b-2ef2-45aa-82b4-4f0345ad8b10","expr":"fqClassName.lastIndexOf('.') <= fqClassName.length() - 1","rationale":"Ensures lastIndexOf('.') result is within valid string index range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:07.994505324Z"}
{"id":"3af7f6a4-0890-4c41-b4f3-6315ad5d4ea6","expr":"fqClassName.length() > 0","rationale":"The fqClassName should not be empty string for package extraction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:07.994505324Z"}
{"id":"c7716b1f-0047-46f2-85d3-76c9e986dfd1","expr":"(!fqClassName.contains(\".\") || fqClassName.indexOf('.') >= 0)","rationale":"This combined condition holds for any string about '.' presence.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:07.994505324Z"}
{"id":"d264f98c-278e-467c-8f2f-1cb2aaea52e9","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an empty string if no package is found, thus result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.037814531Z"}
{"id":"e5f0ddce-26cb-4d90-9b0e-9f464c235bd4","expr":"result.isEmpty() || fqClassName.startsWith(result + \".\")","rationale":"When there is a package, result is the substring up to the last dot, so fqClassName should start with package plus dot.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.037814531Z"}
{"id":"1e242de1-a75e-417c-b707-6ec039ed056d","expr":"result.equals(\"\") || result.indexOf('.') >= 0","rationale":"If there is a package name, it must contain at least one dot, since it is extracted as substring before last dot.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.037814531Z"}
{"id":"bf5ad2a5-0ed6-4811-95ca-8342350c8645","expr":"result.length() < fqClassName.length()","rationale":"If package is non-empty, it is a prefix, so shorter; if empty, length is 0 which is less than class name length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.037814531Z"}
{"id":"82f42f06-83df-40b1-8214-23130f69c927","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || fqClassName.indexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"If result is empty, no dot was found in fqClassName, otherwise lastIndexOf('.') would be >=0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.037814531Z"}
{"id":"6ad490a1-9190-4c67-835d-90421d5a61fc","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result is derived by calling getClass() on the instance, which never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.683473957Z"}
{"id":"7b47ea80-7247-4e6e-894c-c71cac599229","expr":"result.isInstance(instance)","rationale":"The returned class should be assignable from the instance, so instance is an instance of result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.683473957Z"}
{"id":"c8a2cc01-631b-4e04-8103-a2c043921a4a","expr":"result.equals(instance.getClass())","rationale":"The method returns getUserClass(instance.getClass()), defaults to instance.getClass() when no proxy or subclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.683473957Z"}
{"id":"363e2541-5c16-4d1e-89b4-45f5d943b28c","expr":"className != null && !className.isEmpty()","rationale":"className must be non-null and have length greater than zero as per the assertion.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.907128987Z"}
{"id":"32b31051-0dcd-4f30-90e5-71220e036901","expr":"className.lastIndexOf('.') >= -1","rationale":"className.lastIndexOf('.') cannot be less than -1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.907128987Z"}
{"id":"90b39839-2ac4-41dc-bd2d-375ada86d38c","expr":"className.indexOf('$') >= -1","rationale":"className.indexOf('$') cannot be less than -1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.907128987Z"}
{"id":"823ee414-c7c9-4a0e-8f8b-28c64135a4be","expr":"className.length() >= 1","rationale":"Length of className is at least 1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.907128987Z"}
{"id":"4c959fbf-3209-4a95-b608-1f229c9b032a","expr":"className.indexOf('$') <= className.length()","rationale":"The index of '$' cannot exceed the length of the string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:08.907128987Z"}
{"id":"e31bd925-bd6c-4a38-91cb-827a9c4704cb","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"The method checks clazz for null and calls getName(). If clazz is not null, getName() returns a non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.047140794Z"}
{"id":"d661a956-97a2-4b1c-a10b-1a6485d975be","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getName().contains(\"$$\")","rationale":"The characteristic substring '$$' in class name is strongly associated with CGLIB proxy classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.047140794Z"}
{"id":"4a76d926-4174-471f-9c6d-eb2ac51262dd","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.isInterface() == false","rationale":"If clazz is a CGLIB proxy class, it will not be an interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.047140794Z"}
{"id":"ae90f733-c877-457e-8963-e1796a5f7d8f","expr":"result == (className != null && className.contains(\"$$\"))","rationale":"The method returns true if the input string is not null and contains the CGLIB class separator.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.080868014Z"}
{"id":"197d4fd6-9c4e-4a59-95e8-631313dc07af","expr":"!result || (className != null && className.contains(\"$$\"))","rationale":"If the result is true, then className must be non-null and contain the CGLIB separator.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.080868014Z"}
{"id":"bcf88df5-07e8-4c57-9465-66f7dc8153dc","expr":"result == (className != null && className.indexOf(\"$$\") >= 0)","rationale":"The presence of the CGLIB separator substring implies the result is true, expressed with indexOf.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.080868014Z"}
{"id":"a56bde49-c5e7-47bb-94e9-8ca40d1a5811","expr":"!result || className.length() >= 2","rationale":"If result is true, the string must contain the CGLIB separator, so its length must be at least as long as the separator.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.080868014Z"}
{"id":"161e7af5-3245-4c4b-a94d-0552a43077ce","expr":"className == null || result == className.contains(\"$$\")","rationale":"Per contract, if className is null, result must be false, otherwise result matches the contains check.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.080868014Z"}
{"id":"e3876854-5141-4d69-8fb9-ae0abbdaeed6","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter must be non-null for getQualifiedMethodName to operate.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.140988007Z"}
{"id":"e13ff53f-29e2-4a6d-8b79-ba8aa2467433","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"A Method instance always has a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.140988007Z"}
{"id":"df4fbd36-2bc2-4066-957f-535a9059fd27","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"Every Method is declared by some class, so the declaring class is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.140988007Z"}
{"id":"7c4ce13f-710b-4744-a734-e27aba034e3d","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(method.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The declaring class of the method is always assignable from itself.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.140988007Z"}
{"id":"81278694-856e-4a2a-8781-42deb98f6e53","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a non-null qualified name string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.182374447Z"}
{"id":"1c745b64-c787-4997-a718-b89f0438badf","expr":"result.contains(method.getName())","rationale":"The qualified name must include the method name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.182374447Z"}
{"id":"20126d6a-ac37-4a7e-8657-d13b8e42e864","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"A qualified method name cannot be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.182374447Z"}
{"id":"8005e0f2-6126-4b34-ae59-834a880d57d4","expr":"result.startsWith(method.getDeclaringClass().getName())","rationale":"A qualified method name includes the declaring class name as a prefix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:09.182374447Z"}
{"id":"d8db6653-d91d-4bd7-a498-f394c33208fb","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method starts with Assert.notNull(clazz), ensuring clazz must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:10.048093649Z"}
{"id":"1c9304be-0f7f-443e-a39e-fce99acbc269","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"Since clazz is non-null, clazz.getName() returns a non-null String representing the fully qualified class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:10.048093649Z"}
{"id":"dd2217d7-f01f-4540-8a80-8bfd558df68e","expr":"clazz.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"The class name String is expected to be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:10.048093649Z"}
{"id":"d6f6c0d9-0666-4259-8083-9c9a4ae87911","expr":"!clazz.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Typically the method is called with reference types; primitive classes do not have packages.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:10.048093649Z"}
{"id":"a61b77d4-5c43-4d6a-9878-cd1fcf2854fe","expr":"!clazz.isArray()","rationale":"The method design assumes clazz is not an array class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:10.048093649Z"}
{"id":"f804c48a-cf1d-46e9-9a3a-1ca5e9d6a1b6","expr":"result != null && !result.isEmpty()","rationale":"Since result is a substring of className after some index, it must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:11.761679122Z"}
{"id":"c6678ed8-2f75-4919-99ca-e649aed9c60e","expr":"!result.contains(\".\")","rationale":"The method returns a short name without package prefixes, so it should not contain the package separator character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:11.761679122Z"}
{"id":"a63b1f76-1801-4828-b830-020eacd00aaf","expr":"result.indexOf('$') == -1","rationale":"Nested class separator characters ('$') are replaced by the package separator in the result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:11.761679122Z"}
{"id":"ea63440d-79da-456f-b158-6b46b2cd7276","expr":"result.length() <= className.length()","rationale":"Result is a substring of className, so its length can never exceed the original className length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:11.761679122Z"}
{"id":"9757761f-50f8-4ef9-80b8-1838549cc20f","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"A non-null class is required to determine if it has a constructor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:11.817801764Z"}
{"id":"0c3590b0-fda7-45f4-b645-fae28e955609","expr":"paramTypes != null","rationale":"Non-nullity of paramTypes ensures the method can safely check constructors with given parameter signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:11.817801764Z"}
{"id":"bad87fd4-9e7b-4d66-a92a-97cf559cfa63","expr":"paramTypes.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"Ensures paramTypes can be treated as the varargs Class parameter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:11.817801764Z"}
{"id":"13afc76b-8da3-4663-a979-a78c88b46a8f","expr":"clazz.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Indicates that clazz is not an interface, relevant as interfaces do not have constructors.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:11.817801764Z"}
{"id":"896d7ce9-658a-4ddc-adb5-76c7db9972be","expr":"clazz.getClassLoader() != null","rationale":"Having a class loader is typical for classes that can have constructors.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:11.817801764Z"}
{"id":"aae67c93-4361-4695-89d4-ca665430875c","expr":"clazz != null && paramTypes != null || !result","rationale":"The method returns true only if a constructor with the given parameter types is available, which requires clazz and paramTypes not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:11.855329695Z"}
{"id":"d4833aab-53dd-4d96-8500-82023bd4840f","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The parameter clazz is asserted non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.285436908Z"}
{"id":"429a7581-352b-4127-ab56-b9521c603f5b","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"The clazz parameter may represent non-primitive types; we note the primitive distinction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.285436908Z"}
{"id":"6790044a-0da4-4772-a1d3-0c6932b8c798","expr":"clazz.getCanonicalName() != null || clazz.getTypeName() != null","rationale":"Either the class has a canonical name or it has a type name that is never null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.285436908Z"}
{"id":"40085f5c-ab8c-469c-8f35-887b0f828347","expr":"(clazz.getCanonicalName() == null) == (!clazz.isAnonymousClass() && !clazz.isLocalClass() && !clazz.isMemberClass())","rationale":"Canonical name being null correlates with the class being anonymous, local, or possibly member class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.285436908Z"}
{"id":"a5323b95-2012-471d-9b23-f2b00520ca00","expr":"clazz.getTypeName().equals(clazz.toString().substring(6))","rationale":"The type name matches the class's string representation minus the leading class keyword.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.285436908Z"}
{"id":"1ea8847b-6b1e-46b5-ac7d-af85c7c7bf50","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method throws an exception if clazz is null, so it must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.505855942Z"}
{"id":"48e7a9a0-4bce-4df6-8b90-ab3f46c092e2","expr":"clazz.getCanonicalName() == null || clazz.getCanonicalName().equals(clazz.getTypeName())","rationale":"If canonical name is non-null, it is usually equal to the type name for typical classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.505855942Z"}
{"id":"125c3bd9-b59c-41eb-9183-556f2da9ee5b","expr":"clazz.isArray() == (clazz.getComponentType() != null)","rationale":"If clazz is an array, getComponentType() returns non-null, otherwise null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.505855942Z"}
{"id":"bd19edce-deea-469d-a905-1dd467f8ef31","expr":"clazz.getName().equals(clazz.getTypeName()) || clazz.getName().contains(\"$\")","rationale":"Class#getName() may return something equal to getTypeName() or with '$' for nested classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.505855942Z"}
{"id":"a7ade341-6adb-4c58-89f4-2c16c2de716c","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts clazz must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.558981089Z"}
{"id":"c0b90fa6-588e-47a1-89f5-d7226bc2f5ec","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method asserts method must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.558981089Z"}
{"id":"0a41d8fb-22cc-4856-bf2a-1533c6b4e19b","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"A Method object always has a non-null declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.558981089Z"}
{"id":"2c32bcd9-34e0-4690-b970-f3abac778a1f","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method name is always non-null in Java reflection.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.558981089Z"}
{"id":"de274bab-35b9-4803-b1df-680c597a7e85","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"getParameterTypes returns a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.558981089Z"}
{"id":"07efac9a-dfe5-4fa9-8307-3c01f0ac941a","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Methods can only be searched if the clazz parameter is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.632462740Z"}
{"id":"0431ab35-b85f-4344-a277-6f942a62c9c6","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"A method must have a non-null methodName for meaningful search.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.632462740Z"}
{"id":"495bd71e-cb44-44fd-90cd-b00a34877119","expr":"paramTypes != null","rationale":"ParamTypes may be empty, but the varargs array itself should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.632462740Z"}
{"id":"bc87880e-96d7-421f-bb41-80188fe4117a","expr":"(methodName.length() > 0) || (paramTypes.length >= 0)","rationale":"Method name should be non-empty or the paramTypes length is measured.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.632462740Z"}
{"id":"52a67401-0a4f-416c-ae18-fc3189ddff74","expr":"clazz.isInterface() || !clazz.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Typically, methods searched for are not primitives or are interface types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.632462740Z"}
{"id":"4e4de22d-d9f1-4480-a155-2d65bb53f35a","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts clazz must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.712264695Z"}
{"id":"c707e6e7-8f20-4c07-b582-220068808b3d","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"The method asserts methodName must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.712264695Z"}
{"id":"831dfe45-4f07-437c-ad5c-9143a5090905","expr":"clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"Demonstrates usage of valid clazz instance, but not a useful invariant; included for demonstration.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.712264695Z"}
{"id":"13f2c69f-4d42-47bf-b63a-e7d7c71b40f8","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null Method or throws an exception, so result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.746770934Z"}
{"id":"141e94c1-421b-4dad-ae95-2cbc563d35ec","expr":"result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"The returned method must have the requested methodName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.746770934Z"}
{"id":"3628812c-c0df-4599-a54b-271a9eb418b7","expr":"result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"The returned method is declared by a class assignable from clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.746770934Z"}
{"id":"7c1baf35-58fc-47b7-9161-3d4f66f5a553","expr":"result != null","rationale":"getPackageName returns empty string if no package, but never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.834430794Z"}
{"id":"33d80875-e243-48c4-996f-8823b8f9b350","expr":"result.isEmpty() || result.indexOf('.') >= 0","rationale":"Package names are either empty string or formed of dot-separated names, so the result is either empty or contains a dot.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.834430794Z"}
{"id":"5f47cada-5126-4acf-8da9-88b01e2b6f32","expr":"result.length() <= clazz.getName().length()","rationale":"Since the package name is a substring prefix of the full class name string, its length is less than or equal to that of the full class name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:12.834430794Z"}
{"id":"fa7982ac-dc3f-4bc6-9b69-72d87f7b7449","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getTypeName())","rationale":"The return value result must be exactly clazz.getTypeName() as per the return statement.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:13.004326530Z"}
{"id":"872e28b8-7387-4210-b391-479649e19086","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Class#getTypeName() returns a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:13.004326530Z"}
{"id":"3382325f-9da8-44b9-aecd-77786519ea43","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The fully qualified name of a class is never an empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:13.004326530Z"}
{"id":"f787ef3b-6a30-414c-a10d-82e9cbb33bcb","expr":"result.contains(clazz.getSimpleName())","rationale":"The result string should contain the simple class name as a substring.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:13.004326530Z"}
{"id":"42258e6d-11b0-4973-84d6-e6520e6554be","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter is asserted to be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:13.164067289Z"}
{"id":"9bf9ca37-1017-4f93-88c4-7424c256c578","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.isAssignableFrom(method.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"If clazz is not null, it should be assignable from method's declaring class to be a valid qualifier.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:13.164067289Z"}
{"id":"1a4776db-3104-452b-8999-176fd4678483","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Java Method.getName() always returns a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:13.164067289Z"}
{"id":"b9753a50-318a-4e12-8d34-4b1ab9d0a89f","expr":"(clazz != null && clazz.getName() != null) || (method.getDeclaringClass().getName() != null)","rationale":"Both clazz and method.getDeclaringClass() have non-null fully qualified names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:13.164067289Z"}
{"id":"76eeb9b4-3098-4d2b-aa5f-97cdf2262cbb","expr":"(clazz != null) || (clazz == null && method.getDeclaringClass() != null)","rationale":"The method implementation chooses clazz if non-null, else uses method's declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:13.164067289Z"}
{"id":"355f8ffd-3404-433d-b748-00713f8adc40","expr":"result.startsWith((clazz != null ? clazz : method.getDeclaringClass()).getName() + \".\")","rationale":"The result is composed by concatenating the class name (from clazz if non-null otherwise method's declaring class) plus '.' plus method name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:14.063942701Z"}
{"id":"957ac40b-f036-4f91-a819-cca257f3d9b5","expr":"result.endsWith(method.getName())","rationale":"The returned qualified name always ends with the method's simple name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:14.063942701Z"}
{"id":"3d65b767-7de1-4382-9a5d-e7c19090d0c0","expr":"result.equals((clazz != null ? clazz : method.getDeclaringClass()).getName() + \".\" + method.getName())","rationale":"This directly encodes the method's returned string expression.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:14.063942701Z"}
{"id":"436050ba-76c1-4a9b-b25f-c95f5698feaf","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Based on the method implementation, the returned string 'result' cannot be null because if clazz.getCanonicalName() returns null, clazz.getTypeName() is returned which is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:14.209095316Z"}
{"id":"434bf3af-feb0-4521-9c31-b6607bced25e","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getCanonicalName()) || result.equals(clazz.getTypeName())","rationale":"The method directly returns canonicalName if not null, else typeName. So result must be equal to one of these two.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:14.209095316Z"}
{"id":"d421ffe7-5cbe-4154-aae4-2d12f23fc043","expr":"result.length() == clazz.getCanonicalName().length() || result.length() == clazz.getTypeName().length()","rationale":"Since result equals either canonicalName or typeName, their length must match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:14.209095316Z"}
{"id":"b4edda24-af77-4439-8232-5278d94d3aab","expr":"!result.equals(clazz.getCanonicalName()) || clazz.getCanonicalName() != null","rationale":"If result equals canonicalName, then canonicalName must be non-null; this invariant expresses that.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:14.209095316Z"}
{"id":"942ae85f-9087-4eb8-bc18-c081ca069a95","expr":"(result != null) || (clazz.getConstructor(paramTypes) == null)","rationale":"If no matching constructor exists, result is null; else result is the constructor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.163211056Z"}
{"id":"fe4cc871-fe95-4c3f-ad4a-7163923607bb","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().equals(clazz)","rationale":"If a constructor is found, it must belong to the clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.163211056Z"}
{"id":"93accc82-d65d-4b90-aadd-d52eb1aab1aa","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method explicitly asserts that clazz is not null before attempting to get the constructor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.287346421Z"}
{"id":"196752fc-f22d-44ec-a5e4-ae61a8b0d906","expr":"paramTypes != null","rationale":"The varargs parameter paramTypes can be an empty array but should not be null for safe handling by getConstructor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.287346421Z"}
{"id":"f4f7ef8b-22a5-4cf4-a23b-5328f7784be3","expr":"paramTypes.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"paramTypes is a varargs Class<?> array, checking that it is indeed an array type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.287346421Z"}
{"id":"51a5d023-eb39-4bb9-a499-ef2985c756b4","expr":"clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"A trivial but non-redundant check that clazz's Class object is assignable from itself.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.287346421Z"}
{"id":"4434ed97-69a4-4147-af26-6cfccf7ad8d1","expr":"(paramTypes.length == 0) || (paramTypes.length > 0)","rationale":"Ensures paramTypes array length is non-negative and valid for use in getConstructor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.287346421Z"}
{"id":"8bbc074d-8eba-4ef1-a036-f6db20b14937","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts that clazz is not null, so this invariant always holds at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.374612528Z"}
{"id":"31a2db08-fdf8-4fbb-9aaa-1d9f4a173df5","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"The method asserts that methodName is not null, so this invariant always holds at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.374612528Z"}
{"id":"82500bea-a3ac-4813-bfd5-a4d23c5dbe9e","expr":"clazz.getDeclaredMethods().length >= 0","rationale":"The declaredMethods array's length property is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.374612528Z"}
{"id":"52b31a4d-9346-4b16-ac8a-73bd3ffa83ad","expr":"clazz.getInterfaces().length >= 0","rationale":"The interfaces array's length property is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.374612528Z"}
{"id":"3269a0fb-4446-4583-9d4e-79fb30c9ac37","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter should be non-null as it is used in method calls within the method's body.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.437383001Z"}
{"id":"751d4813-a08a-414a-ac77-50c56d10b3c5","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"Every Method object is declared by some class or interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.437383001Z"}
{"id":"23a9fdfc-d500-4a6f-9e5a-d370b4e90fa6","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass().isInterface() || !method.getDeclaringClass().isInterface()","rationale":"The declaring class of method is either an interface or not, which gives a meaningful branching consideration.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.437383001Z"}
{"id":"de2acd33-0f42-44c8-882d-863272c609e6","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Ensures the parameter count is a valid non-negative number.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.437383001Z"}
{"id":"f979a9ff-096d-49c4-b80a-3e94a9008e69","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"A method object always should have a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.437383001Z"}
{"id":"3bf3363b-e257-4a98-a80c-4f5012269db3","expr":"result == null || result.isInterface()","rationale":"The method aims to get an interface method if possible, so the returned Method either is null or represents an interface method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.481961814Z"}
{"id":"656c8fa0-b5be-435f-a790-fc41e6a2deff","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isInterface()","rationale":"This aligns with the method's goal to return an interface method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.481961814Z"}
{"id":"ac58246f-cba8-4a62-a731-57a1facdee3d","expr":"result == null || method.getName().equals(result.getName())","rationale":"The interface method returned (if any) should correspond to the original method name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.481961814Z"}
{"id":"cfc7c5f8-0869-4d36-b8a2-b054f3bda53f","expr":"clazz != null && methodName != null","rationale":"The method starts with assertions ensuring clazz and methodName are not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.603683615Z"}
{"id":"2f278415-5b07-446e-a8bf-bac62fce51c2","expr":"paramTypes == null || paramTypes.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"paramTypes is a varargs array and may be null or a Class<?>[] array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.603683615Z"}
{"id":"4e114e30-d4e4-4e17-95e7-8c0ce3462d8a","expr":"methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"Reasonable assumption that methodName is non-empty as it represents a method name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:15:16.603683615Z"}
