{"id":"224fc193-bc7b-4ffc-bc8b-317c9e384040","expr":"fieldName != null && !fieldName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, field names are non-null and non-empty to serve as meaningful labels in toString representations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,int):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:41.367250235Z"}
