{"id":"c6db2ccb-5039-457e-8b01-1f794aa168c9","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns 'result', it must be non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,int):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:41.373351514Z"}
{"id":"233a84ab-e4d8-4f50-a5ab-19cfb9f60678","expr":"result.toString().contains(fieldName)","rationale":"The method appends the fieldName and its value to the ToStringCreator so the string representation should contain the fieldName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,int):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:41.373351514Z"}
