{"id":"64b7e16d-d15d-4ee8-868c-acb6bec79d48","expr":"result.toString().contains(Integer.toString(value))","rationale":"The method wraps the int value as an Integer and appends it, hence its string representation should appear in the result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,int):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:41.373351514Z"}
