{"id":"987652cf-585d-493c-850d-cdaae57e9e94","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a ToStringCreator instance, typically 'this' or a non-null object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,double):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:41.401165010Z"}
