{"id":"e3ca60c4-3e49-4d5e-9c0b-6520a6bbc285","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null ToStringCreator instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,boolean):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:41.409604760Z"}
{"id":"5d08bc32-1853-4e64-b5a0-4484fa20663b","expr":"fieldName == null || result.toString().contains(fieldName)","rationale":"If fieldName is provided, the result string often includes it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,boolean):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:41.409604760Z"}
