{"id":"7cf4d580-66b6-46ea-8cf9-c308400f9c94","expr":"!(fieldName != null && fieldName.isEmpty())","rationale":"This expresses that when fieldName is not null, it is not empty, consistent with typical usage patterns.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:41.413656954Z"}
