{"id":"6c7774ae-1ebc-4530-81f2-0f69b36cf87f","expr":"fieldName == null || result.toString().contains(fieldName)","rationale":"If the fieldName is non-null, the string representation of result typically includes the fieldName since it is appended by styling.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:41.417837349Z"}
