{"id":"150bdb52-8da4-4fa4-b2a3-c08d093ae542","expr":"value != null","rationale":"The append method likely expects a non-null object to style and append.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.943663811Z"}
