{"id":"8a76eb4b-3968-488d-b350-fe943aec2caa","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"A Class object's getName() must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.983541323Z"}
{"id":"2379ab36-7a74-4360-a604-bb8f2eef0a59","expr":"!clazz.isArray() || clazz.getComponentType() != null","rationale":"If clazz represents an array type, its component type must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.983541323Z"}
{"id":"ef1887e7-9df1-45f4-9e73-d70fae8108fd","expr":"clazz.getSimpleName() != null","rationale":"The simple name of the class should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.983541323Z"}
{"id":"23c93259-1176-49f2-8788-77ba66da2371","expr":"clazz != null && result != null && result.equals(clazz.getSimpleName()) || result.equals(clazz.getName()) || result.equals(clazz.toString()) || true","rationale":"Given styleClass returns a styled String of clazz, result is related to clazz's name or string representation","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.987747677Z"}
{"id":"e62058fb-72a5-47f4-bf1b-04e025d71140","expr":"result != null && result.length() > 0","rationale":"If result is non-null, it should be a non-empty string","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.987747677Z"}
{"id":"0a324c12-4135-41e5-b85c-4b33f6c15a3c","expr":"clazz != null || result == null","rationale":"If clazz is null, result may be null but not vice versa","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.987747677Z"}
{"id":"6454eaba-c3b5-4bd2-a246-c80a9f1358e4","expr":"result != null && result.indexOf(' ') < 0","rationale":"Result string usually has no spaces since class names don't contain spaces","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.987747677Z"}
{"id":"b1e5a444-d875-4772-8609-ea22cbb3bbd9","expr":"clazz != null && clazz.isPrimitive() == (result.length() <= 8)","rationale":"The length of the returned string may be small if the class is primitive; this is a heuristic","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.987747677Z"}
{"id":"99e2a6c2-535a-44cd-b7ed-9822329ea538","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter must be non-null to safely call methodStyler.apply(method) without NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.991712897Z"}
{"id":"2831506e-440b-4963-9071-0d6b1b8e80b9","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"A Method object always has an associated declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.991712897Z"}
{"id":"c84650b2-23be-40e1-96db-211817495e5d","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method.getName() returns the method's name string, which is never null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.991712897Z"}
{"id":"2692f81d-b91c-4946-ba54-e9ebf21deb86","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Java Method objects always have zero or more parameters, never negative count.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.991712897Z"}
{"id":"a8dbfac1-1582-4f3c-adee-97ee0130f384","expr":"method.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Every Method has a return Type object associated with it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.991712897Z"}
{"id":"307d7a94-8521-4a6e-b7f7-8478e9fdc7ab","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned string result should never be null, as it is the value of methodStyler.apply(method).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.995556377Z"}
{"id":"36972ce2-64be-46f8-9b7e-fe5963f71a93","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The styling of the method usually produces a non-empty string representing the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.995556377Z"}
{"id":"f8789696-977b-4bc7-b459-41f921505a04","expr":"result.contains(method.getName())","rationale":"The styled string typically includes the method's name to identify it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.995556377Z"}
{"id":"50c356b5-b780-4fe9-ba5c-d35694781d19","expr":"result.length() > 0 && method.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Both the method's name and the styled string are expected to be non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.995556377Z"}
{"id":"17d2a377-a900-48cf-ab82-4c9549cc2355","expr":"map != null","rationale":"The map parameter must be non-null for the method to execute correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.999375662Z"}
{"id":"0eb2cda0-22e8-4bf8-b861-be39b1be326c","expr":"map.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size of the map cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.999375662Z"}
{"id":"3a58f5fe-2158-4bc1-aee4-63c3bdd21937","expr":"map.entrySet() != null","rationale":"map.entrySet() always returns a non-null set of entries.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.999375662Z"}
{"id":"037b12a4-6bab-47c0-ad4a-7e796c8c5e98","expr":"(map.isEmpty() && map.size() == 0) || (!map.isEmpty() && map.size() > 0)","rationale":"Emptiness of the map correlates correctly with its size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:42.999375662Z"}
{"id":"7d228516-6b87-46e3-96b2-3359563dc780","expr":"map == null || (result.length() >= 2)","rationale":"If map is not null, the minimal string is '{}', length 2.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.003143679Z"}
{"id":"2b74f51e-f18d-45a4-b8ef-29b452deee2c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"StringJoiner.toString() returns a string with the formatted content, not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.003143679Z"}
{"id":"89bd069a-9442-48bf-904f-b15afea8cffd","expr":"collection != null","rationale":"The method iterates over collection, so it must not be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.006798473Z"}
{"id":"d601cc02-f2df-4dc5-9690-92f99fa16bf2","expr":"collection.size() >= 0","rationale":"Collection size is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.006798473Z"}
{"id":"e47cea7f-6fae-4102-88f7-ac1071615cdb","expr":"collection.isEmpty() == (collection.size() == 0)","rationale":"isEmpty() is true iff size() == 0 by specification.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.006798473Z"}
{"id":"3e63f84f-c3cc-4f5a-b9cd-10560bcc1311","expr":"result.startsWith(\"[\") && result.endsWith(\"]\")","rationale":"The method uses StringJoiner with '[' and ']' which guarantees these characters will wrap the string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.010317702Z"}
{"id":"b34221f8-437d-4aaf-97fc-af7a1d020a92","expr":"result.equals(\"[]\") || collection.size() > 0","rationale":"An empty collection yields '[]', non-empty collection result is different from '[]'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.010317702Z"}
{"id":"4a6817fe-1abc-40c9-9f78-67d15f6afa31","expr":"!result.equals(\"[]\") || collection.isEmpty()","rationale":"The result equals '[]' if and only if the collection is empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.010317702Z"}
{"id":"511077e1-0d91-4f0d-822f-627227a42c39","expr":"result.length() >= 2","rationale":"The string always contains the opening and closing brackets, so minimum length is 2.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.010317702Z"}
{"id":"556c2e34-955a-4d4e-8ac6-ffc835725c64","expr":"result.contains(\",\") == (collection.size() > 1)","rationale":"The StringJoiner adds ', ' between elements, so commas appear if collection has more than one element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.010317702Z"}
{"id":"0b47e4d3-e502-4d03-9370-aa3cef81f3e4","expr":"array != null","rationale":"The method iterates over the array, so the input array must not be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.013849955Z"}
{"id":"18f5a8e1-9845-4e01-b4be-4312a8a98dc1","expr":"array.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length in Java is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.013849955Z"}
{"id":"1be7565d-a7d8-4a22-a69e-27d28ad7ffe6","expr":"result.startsWith(\"[\") && result.endsWith(\"]\")","rationale":"The result string represents the styled array enclosed in square brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.017193652Z"}
{"id":"d41948d6-8a6e-4e13-918b-4a910f90d599","expr":"(array.length == 0 && result.equals(\"[]\")) || (array.length > 0 && !result.equals(\"[]\"))","rationale":"The result is \"[]\" only when the array is empty; otherwise, it contains at least one element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.017193652Z"}
{"id":"1b08e0a9-1874-4072-b739-ec379694d7c8","expr":"result.length() >= 2","rationale":"The result string always has at least the opening and closing brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.017193652Z"}
{"id":"a4261b5c-9613-42ec-9feb-6826c2a4f8d4","expr":"!result.contains(\", ]\")","rationale":"The resulting string should not have a comma immediately before the closing bracket.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.017193652Z"}
{"id":"7d042a64-752c-4e1f-8bd8-1ee355dba2a8","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter cannot be null to generate its signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.020755231Z"}
{"id":"c3998bad-cf47-42e4-9403-6e6e3c83d0b2","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Java reflection guarantees getName() returns non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.020755231Z"}
{"id":"14b45423-b3f8-4df2-b07d-af47dc12ba8a","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"method.getParameterTypes() never returns null according to JDK spec.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.020755231Z"}
{"id":"1d8bb67f-b303-43a5-bc66-a9ea7adbb285","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.020755231Z"}
{"id":"3fad83c5-828e-41a8-aca1-3efd838b3d54","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The Java API guarantees that String.format returns a non-null String, so result is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.024326637Z"}
{"id":"4746d1d7-ceb1-4f46-8b5f-6fc7f25a5e8e","expr":"result.startsWith(method.getName() + \"(\")","rationale":"The format string puts method name followed by '(' before the parameter list, so the result must start like that.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.024326637Z"}
{"id":"42c7880c-a5dd-4668-8ea5-b7366ea8b58c","expr":"result.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"The String.format call appends a closing parenthesis at the end of the signature string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.024326637Z"}
{"id":"6ab14610-b567-4312-8205-f31aef8ce2ea","expr":"result.contains(\"(\") && result.indexOf('(') < result.indexOf(')')","rationale":"The signature syntax enforces an opening parenthesis that must appear before the closing parenthesis in the result string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.024326637Z"}
{"id":"dc9f971e-1fce-4b83-8444-9b2e00936121","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The method appends a character to buffer, so buffer cannot be null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldSeparator(StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.243137767Z"}
{"id":"4c488c87-65d4-4a3e-97bc-3b2839f416f2","expr":"buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"StringBuilder length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldSeparator(StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.243137767Z"}
{"id":"abb5147a-a48d-4c99-93fb-6d34e4257d2e","expr":"buffer.toString().indexOf(',') == -1 || buffer.charAt(buffer.length() - 1) != ','","rationale":"Since the method appends a comma, at entry it is likely that buffer does not already end with a comma (to avoid duplicates).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldSeparator(StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.243137767Z"}
{"id":"a759214c-d573-4b1c-b400-7e04fe8cb756","expr":"fieldName != null && !fieldName.isEmpty()","rationale":"fieldName should be non-null and not empty since it represents the name of a field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,byte):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.332697316Z"}
{"id":"40345ddb-5543-45dc-9f9b-af488a046df0","expr":"value <= Byte.MAX_VALUE","rationale":"value is a byte, so it must be less than or equal to Byte.MAX_VALUE.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,byte):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.332697316Z"}
{"id":"4e664110-2938-464f-b93e-269be391c291","expr":"value >= Byte.MIN_VALUE","rationale":"value is a byte, so it must be greater than or equal to Byte.MIN_VALUE.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,byte):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.332697316Z"}
{"id":"d9f3a588-87f8-4c17-a3b0-1bbf6fefd43e","expr":"fieldName.length() > 0","rationale":"fieldName is expected to have positive length since it names a field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,byte):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.332697316Z"}
{"id":"b79715ad-e1cf-4132-9f47-c23ab1903b1b","expr":"writer != null","rationale":"The method writes to the provided writer, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(Writer,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.339873252Z"}
{"id":"0f53cccd-2777-47fd-8680-a5afe9b4c821","expr":"comments == null || !comments.isEmpty()","rationale":"Often comments are null or non-empty strings to be meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(Writer,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.339873252Z"}
{"id":"7d0eb2ad-a44f-416f-95b7-3a3acfbe552c","expr":"comments == null || comments.length() >= 0","rationale":"Length check is always true, included for completeness but may be trivial.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(Writer,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.339873252Z"}
{"id":"97d38a63-a99e-4ed6-a938-4d2bc8334619","expr":"writer != null","rationale":"The writer parameter is used to write output lines; hence, it should be non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(Writer,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.346757247Z"}
{"id":"4ce34fbd-94ac-41ca-a0da-6bb48ace6121","expr":"(comments == null) || comments.length() >= 0","rationale":"comments can be null or a non-null String; its length if non-null is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(Writer,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.346757247Z"}
{"id":"6e83f09b-b613-4599-a0dc-99190d1761cb","expr":"out != null","rationale":"The method writes to the OutputStream; a null stream would cause exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#storeToXML(OutputStream,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.353078992Z"}
{"id":"4552d052-1bf7-4bf9-a2c8-eba81f3a2d52","expr":"(comments == null) || (comments.length() >= 0)","rationale":"This confirms comments is either null or a valid string, consistent with usage.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#storeToXML(OutputStream,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.353078992Z"}
{"id":"79fd9b7d-4d6a-41e1-a46e-ea47746dad74","expr":"comments == null || comments.trim().length() >= 0","rationale":"Since comments may be passed or omitted, this invariant captures likely valid contents.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#storeToXML(OutputStream,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:16:43.353078992Z"}
