{"id":"f4aac499-e5e5-431d-9666-7ac61d6f1c96","expr":"separator == null || separator.length() > 0","rationale":"The separator parameter, if not null, is expected to be a non-empty string, consistent with typical separator usage.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#setSeparator(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:19:21.421045695Z"}
