{"id":"864f2207-b6e7-4819-84b6-698d216dd0af","expr":"sourceType.isCollection() == targetType.isCollection()","rationale":"This captures that the method is meant for conversion between collections, so sourceType and targetType are both collections or both not collections.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.convert.support.CollectionToCollectionConverter#matches(TypeDescriptor,TypeDescriptor):boolean","file":"org/springframework/core/convert/support/CollectionToCollectionConverter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:22:25.228171584Z"}
