{"id":"c76e9fb9-07bc-4e9f-9b52-492885f888b0","expr":"result == null || result.getCurrencyCode().equals(source.trim())","rationale":"If the result is not null, its currency code must match the trimmed source string, since the method returns Currency.getInstance(source).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.convert.support.StringToCurrencyConverter#convert(String):Currency","file":"org/springframework/core/convert/support/StringToCurrencyConverter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:22:27.804861490Z"}
