{"id":"f495b664-d42b-460a-b370-abbb320b692b","expr":"result == null || result.getCurrencyCode().length() == 3","rationale":"If result is not null, its currency code string length should be 3 as per ISO 4217 standard.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.convert.support.StringToCurrencyConverter#convert(String):Currency","file":"org/springframework/core/convert/support/StringToCurrencyConverter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:22:27.804861490Z"}
