{"id":"7ae787c2-5258-4562-9613-64e4bc6a7507","expr":"names != null","rationale":"The method presumably uses 'names' for field lookup, so 'names' should be initialized.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.FieldProviderTransformer#getByIndex(String[],int[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/FieldProviderTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:36.678462437Z"}
