{"id":"6b2cd532-bc38-4e95-b4a4-2b7861c93319","expr":"names.length > 0","rationale":"Switching on empty names array is not meaningful, so the array likely has at least one element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.FieldProviderTransformer#getField(String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/FieldProviderTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:37.071145338Z"}
