{"id":"a21d5e98-9bd6-49f8-ba5d-62df41f2606e","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The descriptor returned by type.getDescriptor() must be non-null to generate method signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:39.887555739Z"}
