{"id":"137b3cea-670b-4f37-8a51-3c77b1908eef","expr":"type.getDescriptor().length() > 0","rationale":"The descriptor string must have length greater than zero to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:39.887555739Z"}
{"id":"5278f1df-6bf0-4649-9a25-7879d31a7e08","expr":"sig != null","rationale":"The 'sig' parameter represents the method signature; typically it should not be null because the method requires method signature metadata to proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:39.901699238Z"}
{"id":"5f58b7b5-5369-4b58-bc66-2610e7113ba0","expr":"exceptions != null","rationale":"The 'exceptions' parameter holds the list of exception types the method might throw; usually this is non-null, although it might be an empty array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:39.901699238Z"}
{"id":"5a3440f2-5adb-4467-9531-e645ef3061ad","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"The 'access' integer represents method access flags and modifiers. These flags are bits in a non-negative integer mask, so this is expected to be >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:39.901699238Z"}
{"id":"ba76c138-deb6-4712-abb9-25ae2e34a587","expr":"exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"'exceptions' is an array; its length is zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:39.901699238Z"}
{"id":"bf736eb4-93fe-4aae-982f-4fcb472097f9","expr":"sig.getArgumentTypes() != null","rationale":"The Signature object usually provides non-null argument types array to represent the method's parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:39.901699238Z"}
{"id":"f47e3964-9092-47c5-b591-65f5597d075e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method constructs and returns a new CodeEmitter object wrapping the super begin_method call, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:39.916302554Z"}
{"id":"375ce24b-71a7-4127-9a12-7ad2be7a468e","expr":"names.length > 0","rationale":"The array of field names is expected to be non-empty to be used in the switch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.FieldProviderTransformer#setField(String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/FieldProviderTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:40.774948723Z"}
{"id":"5223fe65-856e-455d-918a-90f581ce5eba","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method uses 'name' to generate a write method signature and access fields, so 'name' should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.141865360Z"}
{"id":"6ad83a48-39f5-4284-95b7-502d79aab519","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The 'type' parameter is used immediately via 'type.getDescriptor()' and other calls, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.141865360Z"}
{"id":"6bbac3c3-1c28-4691-a0a8-f647df2f08cd","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The write method signature depends on the descriptor produced by type.getDescriptor(), so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.141865360Z"}
{"id":"5b5e59f5-fe69-4aa7-8f87-e8d555b25797","expr":"!name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Because the field name must identify a valid field for the write method, it should not be an empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.141865360Z"}
{"id":"cdee2631-e2c3-47ae-ac66-9dd3cc69c5b9","expr":"type.isPrimitive() || !type.isPrimitive()","rationale":"This is a trivial invariant that highlights that 'type.isPrimitive()' returns a boolean logically covering all cases.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.141865360Z"}
{"id":"708a4f1b-2e85-479c-9817-24f6e89b56bb","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method uses name in method preparation and field access, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.171935512Z"}
{"id":"0ce81d99-6fb4-4ccb-b85d-59746f8a31d2","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method uses type in method signature creation and local variable handling, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.171935512Z"}
{"id":"d5bc4941-5539-4ca8-ae96-f9b7589e967d","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The descriptor must be non-null because it is passed to the readMethodSig method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.171935512Z"}
{"id":"6e0e8eb1-f8e6-44db-abd9-6be77dc4bf3d","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"A non-empty field name is necessary for generating valid read method signatures and field accesses.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.171935512Z"}
{"id":"f9845774-0305-420c-a9c4-1f13c32a9483","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is passed to methods and as argument in method calls where null would cause errors.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.429420648Z"}
{"id":"f0ca3b5a-ff81-4b21-bee1-7960fbd48efb","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The 'type' parameter's method getDescriptor() is called, indicating it must not be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:41.429420648Z"}
