{"id":"a94335b9-c7a3-47ed-b795-4c8b1c8b9806","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty() || desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"Both 'name' and 'desc' are used to construct the signature string, so each should be non-null and meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:45.424543510Z"}
{"id":"79a5e1e1-bf7b-4c4a-a818-25a8e8484a6c","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The name string is concatenated as part of the method signature name, so it's likely to be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:45.424543510Z"}
{"id":"4dc0b7a4-af57-4eee-bda9-2d1c30881d2a","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"The description string is used within parentheses as part of the method signature descriptor so expected to be non-null and meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:45.424543510Z"}
{"id":"10663e3a-8f54-4f02-b48f-bb62a8df0c0f","expr":"desc.indexOf(')') == -1","rationale":"Since the returned descriptor adds parentheses around desc, it is likely 'desc' does not contain a closing parenthesis to avoid malformed signature descriptors.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:45.424543510Z"}
{"id":"de84ddf0-3739-4bd7-818f-825c3590b2dd","expr":"name.indexOf('$') == -1","rationale":"To avoid confusion or conflict of symbols, it's likely that name itself does not contain the $ character, as the method prefixes the name with '$cglib_write_'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:45.424543510Z"}
{"id":"84483869-2bf7-41d4-9d69-eaec99ba3662","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method constructs a new Signature instance with strings concatenated from inputs, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:45.533465380Z"}
{"id":"7d66b0bf-b7b0-42e5-8fc6-169ebd7b8429","expr":"result.getDescriptor().equals(\"()\" + desc)","rationale":"Method constructs the Signature descriptor as '()' + desc.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:45.533465380Z"}
