{"id":"6a81492d-4e8d-4f3c-b778-92289573bbc3","expr":"result.getArgumentTypes().length == 3","rationale":"The method creates a Signature with three argument types, so result's argument array length must be 3.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readCallbackSig(Type):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:48.428825414Z"}
{"id":"3ac84828-90e4-4277-98a6-c72bd296d18c","expr":"type != null","rationale":"Non-null type is required to call remap(type) and generate a Signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeCallbackSig(Type):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:48.641431735Z"}
