{"id":"c509766a-4d88-4aa9-bb2f-ea38e4e3c279","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access is an integer representing the access flags, which are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AccessFieldTransformer#declare_field(int,String,Type,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AccessFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:51.611973736Z"}
{"id":"7bd049ff-3d38-4c2b-9d2f-61e0313d4e1b","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Field name must be a non-empty string for generating valid methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AccessFieldTransformer#declare_field(int,String,Type,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AccessFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:51.611973736Z"}
{"id":"1f90ae02-a329-452a-b767-5c1b727c6182","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method uses `name` to generate signatures and field accesses, it is likely non-null and non-empty at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AccessFieldTransformer#declare_field(int,String,Type,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AccessFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:51.616708066Z"}
{"id":"e0438878-cf84-439f-919a-6eb482dade9c","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The field type used in signature is required and should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AccessFieldTransformer#declare_field(int,String,Type,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AccessFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:51.616708066Z"}
