{"id":"9a801239-fe1f-45ff-8a62-ed1d11dbd8cc","expr":"oldValue != newValue || true","rationale":"Although trivial, correctness of this invariant expresses that there is no restriction on differences between oldValue and newValue before method execution.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#writeBoolean(Object,String,boolean,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:25:51.652430129Z"}
