{"id":"3d07cdd2-4f96-4722-a1dd-3e123d784797","expr":"(value == null) || true","rationale":"The value parameter is an Object and can be null or any object instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.584971934Z"}
{"id":"c20cd9d3-836f-47fb-9235-de60a18b7dce","expr":"(access & 0xFFFF) == access","rationale":"Access flags are usually contained within lower bits.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.584971934Z"}
{"id":"9c6c6737-8c47-43b1-8927-572b68bd7b3b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"According to the code, if both fv1 and fv2 are non-null, a new FieldVisitorTee is returned, which is non-null; if one is null, the other (non-null) is returned; so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.592607156Z"}
{"id":"110b9a55-8a2d-4953-8221-8b1b8ad274c4","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method name is expected to be a valid string representing the method identifier.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.599611569Z"}
{"id":"af3ef3c0-20a3-4782-bda1-3294802a86d6","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor encodes the method's parameters and return type and is expected to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.599611569Z"}
{"id":"fb511cd1-b5fb-4fd5-9da3-a51c927483f6","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() > 0","rationale":"Signature is optional and may be null, but if present, it is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.599611569Z"}
{"id":"4037cac4-2a73-4000-a8df-e6af9b39d56b","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"Exceptions parameter may be null or an array representing exceptions thrown by the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.599611569Z"}
{"id":"db7b091c-4b3f-4996-ba84-f41452accdf5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"When either mv1 or mv2 is non-null, result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.606837649Z"}
