{"id":"ab519a8d-8b14-49c8-bb23-5f8ad557f035","expr":"source != null || debug == null","rationale":"There is no direct dependence between source and debug's nullness","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.613439392Z"}
{"id":"e917b370-efc4-4815-b39e-e504d1054361","expr":"source == null || debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"The debug string can be null or non-null. If non-null, its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.620663219Z"}
{"id":"716fb9b1-9550-4c6e-a031-a21246b41ae5","expr":"source == null || source.length() >= 0","rationale":"The source string length is non-negative when source is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.620663219Z"}
{"id":"7398b71b-a8e9-4b86-b906-e61a70905ab7","expr":"(source == null) || (debug == null) || true","rationale":"No strong logical relation between source and debug can be derived here, but both can be null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.620663219Z"}
