{"id":"1b4f99d6-f34c-4592-831d-1f7b0b9c8f7c","expr":"(name == null) || (name.length() > 0)","rationale":"Outer class method name may be null, or if present, should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.628056314Z"}
{"id":"bc95bf4b-3bbd-4c89-b583-759c325b1de4","expr":"(desc == null) || (desc.length() > 0)","rationale":"Descriptor may be null or a valid non-empty string describing method signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.628056314Z"}
{"id":"dcd96b0e-8d3d-4292-8ce7-f7b12b70c1ab","expr":"(name != null) || (desc == null)","rationale":"name and desc represent method name and signature; if descriptor is present, method name should be too.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.628056314Z"}
{"id":"7f858d84-49d6-450b-bf82-eb3b096170cf","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"owner identifies a class name and should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.628056314Z"}
{"id":"758a9891-ab38-4f37-8340-bb6b3b79dbfc","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter must not be null as it is directly used in method calls cv1.visitOuterClass and cv2.visitOuterClass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.635675517Z"}
{"id":"e8d75d2d-0027-4d1c-bc9c-85e826dd3e21","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Similarly, 'name' should not be null because it is used as a parameter in the invoked methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.635675517Z"}
{"id":"24299c44-2244-4d3a-80d4-cef9818a77ff","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The 'desc' string parameter is also used without null checks, implying it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.635675517Z"}
{"id":"3de11991-9140-4257-afcc-7e7e40dbea6c","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"Typically, the 'owner' string in ASM or similar bytecode libraries represents a class name and is expected to be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.635675517Z"}
{"id":"bfea941a-df43-4812-a650-4f739e3bce97","expr":"(!name.isEmpty() && !desc.isEmpty()) || (name == null && desc == null)","rationale":"In ASM, usually name and desc are either both provided with meaningful content or both null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.635675517Z"}
{"id":"c1508c32-9d3a-4ae9-9f2d-7a2e744737d2","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is expected to be a valid type descriptor or annotation description string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.642911015Z"}
{"id":"33a5ca58-ae79-497f-8f00-65daf30a54be","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"Annotation descriptors are non-empty strings indicating annotation type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.642911015Z"}
