{"id":"e0fb0264-f4ab-45c4-bf62-738ae43a20b3","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns the result of AnnotationVisitorTee.getInstance(...) which likely never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.649952307Z"}
{"id":"71eb6072-ab5b-423d-b791-3315a819d090","expr":"!(result == null && desc != null)","rationale":"If desc is not null, then result should not be null since the annotations are being visited.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.649952307Z"}
