{"id":"5e74516f-6131-4147-8681-ddba0074e74d","expr":"attrs != null","rationale":"The method visitAttribute is called with attrs, so attrs is expected not to be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.657015771Z"}
{"id":"87a3ab95-7610-4ba6-aa68-b1de9dd6f969","expr":"!attrs.isEmpty()","rationale":"If Attribute provides an isEmpty() method, the attribute being visited is typically non-empty, but this depends on available methods which are not guaranteed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.657015771Z"}
{"id":"0e30c9c1-7192-45e1-a993-aa8e875924f2","expr":"attrs.toString() != null","rationale":"Typically, toString() returns a non-null string, indicating the attribute can be represented as text.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.657015771Z"}
{"id":"5277b069-8535-4bd9-a32c-9c09c235df00","expr":"attrs.hashCode() >= 0","rationale":"Hash codes should be consistent and mostly non-negative depending on implementation, giving an invariant to consider.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.657015771Z"}
{"id":"4204329d-2bae-4519-95e5-8bec296112bc","expr":"attrs != null","rationale":"The parameter attrs is passed to both cv1 and cv2 visitAttribute calls, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.664260146Z"}
{"id":"be9fac4b-7597-40b1-afe5-c4c68c8bdf1c","expr":"attrs.equals(attrs)","rationale":"Trivial but ensures attrs is a valid object reference.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.664260146Z"}
