{"id":"5a806b9b-1e71-4533-9595-ded8c222f10c","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean flag indicating visibility of the annotation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.671397309Z"}
{"id":"d515f147-39d6-4554-8862-418d8fa8ccbc","expr":"Integer.bitCount(typeRef) <= 32","rationale":"typeRef is an int encoding type annotation reference info; bitCount can indicate non-negative bits set.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.671397309Z"}
{"id":"3d60bd4b-f430-474a-8d83-f758f948264c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns the result of AnnotationVisitorTee.getInstance which presumably never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.678582362Z"}
