{"id":"25c9efda-20ae-4dfc-8fd3-9b48a8cd0db0","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The 'desc' parameter is used as a method argument immediately, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.681903707Z"}
{"id":"63da7aff-8d9b-483e-bb5a-7e53649cca42","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"Annotation descriptor strings are usually non-empty for valid annotations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.681903707Z"}
{"id":"813c658e-9926-4691-ad32-b67c9ad6bb5b","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"The visible parameter must be a boolean value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.681903707Z"}
{"id":"8e19ac41-eb78-4bab-80a8-234c11075b83","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns an AnnotationVisitor obtained from AnnotationVisitorTee.getInstance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.685429748Z"}
{"id":"c73e0380-4c70-44ad-8ada-2ed79261b6da","expr":"(!visible || result != null)","rationale":"The visibility boolean does not affect the non-nullity of the returned AnnotationVisitor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.685429748Z"}
{"id":"dbf9b7cc-f6be-4910-8267-6e1cd2751e38","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method uses attr as an argument, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.688400502Z"}
