{"id":"abc76377-db22-4ef3-8b91-68e4c979f363","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is provided as a type descriptor string that is typically non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.700166707Z"}
