{"id":"b37591fb-f131-4d4c-b443-ae0d13bd50bc","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"typeRef should be a non-negative integer as per Java spec for type annotation targets.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.700166707Z"}
{"id":"de5cadbd-608f-4e06-a8ae-a5c0b18afeb5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned AnnotationVisitor 'result' is constructed via a static getInstance method, so it is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.703482682Z"}
{"id":"23ad94f0-db0c-48e7-942c-d46d47a867fe","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The method likely requires a non-null target ClassVisitor to create the ClassVisitorTee wrapper.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerTee#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.705139767Z"}
{"id":"0755e26d-e8e4-4024-96b0-86d54b96215f","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The method setTarget creates a new ClassVisitorTee with the given target, implying target is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerTee#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.706849813Z"}
{"id":"b0c88b53-a2c2-4f4b-9ed0-94b15a4783ea","expr":"target != null","rationale":"At method entry target should be non-null since it is immediately used in super.setTarget and pass.setTarget.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.711520123Z"}
{"id":"b355cecd-2ac5-40bb-981e-1a66d6a8d674","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The setTarget method typically requires a non-null ClassVisitor to function properly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.716240276Z"}
{"id":"4b996eec-2c23-424d-9b62-2c623ac51d84","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"Class file version should be a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.721393026Z"}
{"id":"148ab08e-7d35-4b84-9b43-8f2dbca565c2","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Internal class name should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.721393026Z"}
{"id":"ff0ad43e-dafb-4591-8d22-161c8f85b29b","expr":"interfaces != null","rationale":"Interfaces array should be initialized, even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.721393026Z"}
{"id":"e803a1de-6b73-4af4-8c0b-448bedca90bc","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() > 0","rationale":"Signature is either null or a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.721393026Z"}
{"id":"6a950de4-12a5-412f-aa22-810c00abb304","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"Version number is expected to be non-negative in visited classes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.727053233Z"}
{"id":"7aa0c970-6d62-4b4e-a0f4-f6ff9701876a","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method likely expects a valid class name string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.727053233Z"}
{"id":"2b688a1e-816c-4b31-86d2-0bbc262fdf5a","expr":"superName == null || !superName.equals(name)","rationale":"Invariants about inheritance hierarchy consistency.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.727053233Z"}
{"id":"351d6d9a-655a-433c-b7a0-5f6dca6ae8af","expr":"interfaces != null","rationale":"Visiting a class normally provides an interfaces array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.727053233Z"}
{"id":"2704272f-10e3-42e0-ac2c-ca916bd66d9a","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags as integer bitmasks are non-negative values.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.727053233Z"}
{"id":"42833a4f-5138-460c-a503-84540b949c29","expr":"source != null","rationale":"Since the source string is passed to another method, it is likely expected not to be null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.732603673Z"}
{"id":"cec4cba0-2157-4716-bd67-dfc277c62e99","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"Debug can be null or a non-empty or empty string at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.732603673Z"}
{"id":"51f18f59-5740-43b4-a0db-2d92387b4725","expr":"source.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.732603673Z"}
{"id":"d534510c-ad81-4daf-9210-f05289e99580","expr":"debug == null || !debug.isEmpty()","rationale":"If debug is non-null, it usually contains information, so not empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.732603673Z"}
{"id":"547b1427-2792-4cf6-9ab4-63d988159fcd","expr":"source == null || source.length() >= 0","rationale":"The source parameter, if not null, is a valid String with a length property.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.738420755Z"}
{"id":"bcc60477-f67b-4675-8d61-3cda303cf154","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"The debug parameter, if not null, is a valid String with a length property.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.738420755Z"}
{"id":"4e7867dc-869f-46d9-93d9-249a2fbe96d3","expr":"source != null || debug != null","rationale":"This is a plausible invariant given that the visitSource call likely involves at least one of the parameters being non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.738420755Z"}
{"id":"76f37653-011f-43fb-8e55-2e3e30682f9a","expr":"(source != null && debug != null) || (source == null || debug == null)","rationale":"This captures a partition of states but is trivial. It is still not tautological because it groups both parameters null and not null states.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.738420755Z"}
{"id":"43564b40-a990-4383-b987-779822740b0f","expr":"source == null || debug == null || source != null && debug != null","rationale":"This expression tries to suggest that either both are null or both are non-null, capturing a possible relation in usage patterns.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.738420755Z"}
{"id":"1cfae37f-9a08-4ad4-9507-ecf40c1456a6","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' should be a valid class name string, most likely not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.744334821Z"}
{"id":"eee00c62-ebdc-4bc8-b29a-b2221565a407","expr":"(name == null) || (name.length() > 0)","rationale":"'name' if defined, should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.744334821Z"}
{"id":"c2f2b373-ae8e-44d3-8589-862f96408c46","expr":"(desc == null) || desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"When 'desc' represents a method signature descriptor, it conventionally starts with '('.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.744334821Z"}
{"id":"3cc9e25f-d39b-4345-a87b-baa72fda73fb","expr":"(name != null) || (desc == null)","rationale":"Either both 'name' and 'desc' are null or 'name' is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.744334821Z"}
{"id":"ac4858ac-4d00-45b5-8dea-2a10969b9c39","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"'owner' is expected to be a non-empty string representing a class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.744334821Z"}
{"id":"56bf8ec4-6758-48b6-8447-089469c455b3","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The owner argument usually represents the internal JVM name of an enclosing class, which should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.750333126Z"}
{"id":"815f47b4-3f97-40bf-9412-fcc3ec38ee2b","expr":"name == null || name.length() > 0","rationale":"When name is provided, it is typically a method name and thus should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.750333126Z"}
{"id":"e8376a45-ce9f-4ac5-9d6e-886484451921","expr":"desc == null || desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"If desc is not null, it is likely a method descriptor, which conventionally starts with '(' in JVM bytecode signatures.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.750333126Z"}
{"id":"2792b74d-aa37-4161-90f1-afb4704fc4dd","expr":"(name == null && desc == null) || (name != null && desc != null)","rationale":"Since name and desc represent the method's name and descriptor, they are likely provided together or both omitted.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.750333126Z"}
{"id":"e88015ba-2f96-4b97-a0fa-12519ce05aea","expr":"owner != null && name != null && desc != null","rationale":"The method delegates to target.visitOuterClass passing these three parameters; likely, none are null when the call occurs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.750333126Z"}
{"id":"a920032b-e230-4780-803a-425af2239239","expr":"desc != null && desc.length() > 0","rationale":"Annotation descriptor strings are non-null and typically non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.755804406Z"}
{"id":"de28cc80-f3ce-4f9a-8e98-c2359974e6ea","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean flag indicating the visibility of the annotation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.755804406Z"}
{"id":"3f0b1610-85f1-4868-a084-b3ecf7a79cbd","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty() && result != null && visible == (visible || !visible)","rationale":"The method delegates visitAnnotation to target, so result corresponds to target's visitAnnotation result which typically expects a non-null desc and returns non-null visitor if annotation is recognized.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.761315272Z"}
{"id":"0aaecf59-04ed-46dd-9842-ccd1b413a76f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"It is likely that visitAnnotation returns a non-null AnnotationVisitor when an annotation matching description is present.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.761315272Z"}
{"id":"a2287a1e-db02-415a-b55e-f51fc091a7dd","expr":"result != null || !visible","rationale":"Usually, visible controls accessibility of annotations; result might be null for invisible annotations.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.761315272Z"}
{"id":"4e151513-83c5-4ab1-9ddb-4357ac4ac068","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method uses attr as a parameter to another method call without a prior null check, so attr must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.766480705Z"}
{"id":"3ae8e9e8-d951-4888-b830-a2fb60f410e1","expr":"attr.getName() != null","rationale":"The Attribute class typically mandates a non-null name field for valid attributes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.766480705Z"}
{"id":"03e68ba7-e22a-4327-a00e-cad9bc7ef538","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method delegates the call to target.visitAttribute(attr), so attr should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.771276041Z"}
{"id":"17088a18-f4cf-4a4f-bbf5-bf12e36b9685","expr":"name != null","rationale":"name is being passed to target.visitInnerClass, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.776606335Z"}
{"id":"f11544de-eafa-4140-849a-252fb9ec6ea7","expr":"innerName != null","rationale":"innerName is being passed to target.visitInnerClass, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.776606335Z"}
{"id":"fd410da8-3374-4ff0-8c05-1ee23cc5b04e","expr":"(outerName == null) || (outerName.length() > 0)","rationale":"outerName may be null or a non-empty string identifying outer class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.776606335Z"}
{"id":"9561d899-4f69-40a0-8b3f-0e40fd531233","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags are typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.776606335Z"}
{"id":"8b028e3f-f0d2-4d28-aa39-3d1cb0d409a3","expr":"!(innerName != null && outerName != null) || !innerName.equals(outerName)","rationale":"If both innerName and outerName are non-null, they should not be equal as inner and outer classes have distinct names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.776606335Z"}
{"id":"f1e2a0bb-5c6a-4c5d-aaf5-da6d744170ac","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0 && !name.contains(\"$\")","rationale":"Typically, inner class names are non-null, non-empty and do not contain the '$' character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.782784920Z"}
{"id":"3cd77250-76e1-446f-8fa0-b9b912e1a05d","expr":"outerName == null || outerName.length() > 0","rationale":"outerName is either null indicating no outer class or a valid non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.782784920Z"}
{"id":"b480ef0c-a3a9-4bce-b949-92c352b720d0","expr":"innerName == null || innerName.length() > 0","rationale":"innerName is either null or a non-empty identifier string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.782784920Z"}
{"id":"efcda32f-af9c-42ae-8286-6edcbcd52c2d","expr":"(access & 0x0001) == 0 || (access & 0x0002) == 0 || (access & 0x0004) == 0","rationale":"Access flags commonly include visibility modifiers corresponding to 0x0001, 0x0002, or 0x0004 bits set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.782784920Z"}
{"id":"683f37e6-4a08-4e37-84a4-1ed394e53643","expr":"name.equals(innerName) || outerName == null","rationale":"Ensures that the inner class name differs from the enclosing class unless outerName is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.782784920Z"}
{"id":"71cbf827-94cc-492d-8ce7-e332ef4d5984","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The field name parameter is expected to be a valid string to identify the field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.788705799Z"}
{"id":"bbcc2be2-5a9c-4184-a493-fe76b7f23ca1","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor string should be non-null to specify the type of the field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.788705799Z"}
{"id":"f499e544-2368-4c03-a261-3ea808572a5c","expr":"(signature == null || signature.length() >= 0)","rationale":"Signature may be null when not provided; if not null, it should be a valid string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.788705799Z"}
{"id":"1c48b9f4-f13d-43aa-afe6-470d38682b55","expr":"value == null || true","rationale":"The initial value is optional and may be any Object or null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.788705799Z"}
{"id":"5e921936-db06-4f58-8d14-a1a0ce930d4e","expr":"(access & ~0xFFFFF) == 0","rationale":"The access modifiers typically use certain bits, this checks for flag mask validity.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:00.788705799Z"}
