{"id":"d4a3a58a-5005-4db2-ace7-d547cdf162d5","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode represents a bytecode operation code which are typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.066106001Z"}
{"id":"7dde9e7a-a7f1-4bfd-866f-3e9157441d86","expr":"cst != null","rationale":"The constant 'cst' passed to visitLdcInsn is typically non-null as it's an operand for ldc instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.073110454Z"}
{"id":"e0b4ef28-5370-4dcb-af02-4e60af93472f","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Since the method calls mv1.visitLabel(label) and mv2.visitLabel(label), label must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.073399990Z"}
{"id":"f3372ebf-6540-4e72-bf1d-075ec3eebee7","expr":"cst != null","rationale":"The constant object cst is forwarded to two method visitors, so it is likely non-null to avoid NPE in the downstream visitLdcInsn calls.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.078105126Z"}
{"id":"cb3cb028-34f0-468d-992f-734ff7cdb609","expr":"cst.getClass().isInstance(cst)","rationale":"cst is an Object so it is trivially an instance of its own class, reinforcing type consistency.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.078105126Z"}
{"id":"25a5ced9-0095-49f1-88a8-48499164f0f7","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"In Java bytecode, the variable index (var) used in IINC instructions is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.081308939Z"}
{"id":"df7ec966-6281-4064-ad43-97528ed32f24","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"Increment is usually non-zero since incrementing by zero would be a no-op.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.081308939Z"}
{"id":"72d969d5-acbc-45da-8d66-bec2bef2e862","expr":"increment >= -128 && increment <= 127","rationale":"In JVM bytecode, the IINC instruction's increment parameter is a signed byte, typically between -128 and 127.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.081308939Z"}
{"id":"71576457-0b9f-41e8-b78b-8f13007a71d1","expr":"target == null || target.getClass() != null","rationale":"The target parameter, if not null, must be a valid ClassVisitor object having a non-null class","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassTransformer#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.082909578Z"}
{"id":"26d31911-0f0a-42d0-a8b2-23815927c3e3","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"The increment parameter usually specifies a non-zero value since zero increment would be redundant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.084777432Z"}
{"id":"642d6faf-32bb-4efb-8580-9782b3c06241","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"Java local variable indices are never negative, so var should be >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.084777432Z"}
{"id":"1ff42490-6708-436e-9e6f-cf999bfc4f28","expr":"Integer.valueOf(var).equals(Integer.valueOf(var))","rationale":"No meaningful invariant, just allowed method usage example","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.084777432Z"}
{"id":"9e668d6c-73a1-4d20-b299-f0010fc8fd52","expr":"(var & 1) == 0 || (var & 1) == 1","rationale":"Bitwise property; explicitly trivial but can be meaningful for more advanced reasoning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.084777432Z"}
{"id":"84a545f2-304e-4bbb-a705-654ec99aab7c","expr":"var < 65536","rationale":"Local variable indices typically fit in a 16-bit index.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.084777432Z"}
{"id":"3df35c19-5eb2-4bc0-a87b-bbaab2020cf6","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels parameter is passed directly without null check, so it is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.089217036Z"}
