{"id":"4816e033-ea78-4c00-81be-ce53f6e8cea8","expr":"dims >= 1","rationale":"The number of dimensions specified by 'dims' should be at least 1 as arrays have at least one dimension.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.097884335Z"}
