{"id":"0ecec7c2-ae38-40ea-9852-b34ce1131258","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start label of a try-catch block is typically expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.105483500Z"}
