{"id":"375162e2-12d5-4dea-9f9e-bc00e78517b0","expr":"line >= 0","rationale":"Line numbers in bytecode represent source code line numbers and are normally non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:26:03.114490860Z"}
