{"id":"0373c3b0-bf4b-4977-95e6-0809c2088fe3","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter represents the class type that owns the static field.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:17.166493814Z"}
{"id":"eab10570-22d7-4470-b63f-e439dda31805","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is the field name for getstatic, and must be a valid string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:17.166493814Z"}
{"id":"c2c7582a-0a50-4a76-bf1f-05b694208f53","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The 'type' parameter indicates the field type being accessed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:17.166493814Z"}
{"id":"d1a97a08-5459-4314-9d96-5ccd7368cd1f","expr":"owner.isArray() == false","rationale":"Static fields are not declared on array types, so owner being an array is invalid for getstatic.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:17.166493814Z"}
{"id":"4a9c1fee-5223-404e-87b0-f611be59d82b","expr":"type.getSort() != 0","rationale":"The 'type' is used in bytecode, so it should be a valid JVM type sort, not unknown (represented by 0).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:17.166493814Z"}
