{"id":"f3848489-673b-4a7b-ac5d-d97226d0c1f6","expr":"ctype != null","rationale":"The method calls ctype.getInternalName() so ctype must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#emit_field(int,Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:22.477235357Z"}
