{"id":"0b64d06f-da4a-4111-b6a3-5bdfa99b1d73","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method calls visitFieldInsn with name. Name must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#emit_field(int,Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:22.477235357Z"}
{"id":"19b111a9-880d-4154-96be-7e6e2f0cd2db","expr":"opcode == 178 || opcode == 179 || opcode == 180 || opcode == 181","rationale":"The opcode likely matches one of GETSTATIC(178), PUTSTATIC(179), GETFIELD(180), PUTFIELD(181).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#emit_field(int,Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:22.476784697Z"}
{"id":"482788fc-ce83-47fa-b8ef-dfc7ae001fb0","expr":"opcode >= 178 && opcode <= 181","rationale":"Opcode must correspond to valid field instruction opcodes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#emit_field(int,Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:22.476784697Z"}
{"id":"5928f38f-8e96-41a0-aeea-43f555eea717","expr":"ctype.getInternalName() != null && ftype.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The JVM method visitFieldInsn expects non-null descriptor and internal name strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#emit_field(int,Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:22.477235357Z"}
{"id":"6735e715-e5ce-4d0a-9343-1ba153f60e8c","expr":"sig.getDescriptor() != null && sig.getDescriptor().startsWith(\"(\") && sig.getDescriptor().contains(\")\")","rationale":"The method descriptor for 'sig' should follow the JVM method descriptor format with parameter parentheses.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#super_invoke(Signature):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:26.121007976Z"}
