{"id":"89988e0a-f281-4677-9996-91838f5edb61","expr":"sig.getParameterTypes() != null && sig.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"The method signature parameter types array should be non-null and can have zero or more parameters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#super_invoke(Signature):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:26.121007976Z"}
{"id":"5e89e1b6-208f-4579-8374-04531c065995","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method invoke_constructor expects a non-null Type object to proceed with constructor invocation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_constructor(Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:26.897687371Z"}
{"id":"ed800dc5-e0be-4378-b787-819bdc77c97f","expr":"type.isClass()","rationale":"The constructor invocation logically requires that 'type' represents a class type, so isClass() should be true.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_constructor(Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:26.897687371Z"}
{"id":"5a0ecae1-9bc9-45a8-836e-2d812356c327","expr":"type.getModifiers() != 0","rationale":"A valid type should have defined modifiers (e.g., public, private); zero indicates no modifiers which is unlikely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_constructor(Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:26.897687371Z"}
{"id":"12092116-b282-44a4-8035-21698bdfbc9b","expr":"(!type.isArray())","rationale":"It is unlikely to invoke a constructor on an array type; type should not represent an array here.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_constructor(Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:26.897687371Z"}
{"id":"c2be8a66-9c32-47b4-b962-d3d6870e0e56","expr":"(!type.isPrimitive())","rationale":"Constructors are only invokable on reference types, so 'type' should not be a primitive type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_constructor(Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:26.897687371Z"}
{"id":"ff94fb7c-3be2-42f6-9f79-c5a6f50f0617","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method invoke_constructor requires a valid Type object to invoke the constructor on; thus type should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_constructor(Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:27.247548647Z"}
{"id":"50e0b798-b560-4438-8b11-cd70c77de6d4","expr":"type.isConstructor() == false","rationale":"The 'type' parameter likely represents a class or interface type, not a constructor; thus type.isConstructor() would normally be false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_constructor(Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:27.247548647Z"}
{"id":"c795f5d4-63df-4ff6-961c-3095acc4bf02","expr":"type.isArray() == false","rationale":"The constructor invocation should normally apply to class types rather than array types, so type.isArray() is false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_constructor(Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:27.247548647Z"}
{"id":"c132a96f-5d64-4ea7-9d2a-4300fb584b8c","expr":"type.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"Invoking a constructor on a primitive type is invalid, so type should not represent a primitive type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_constructor(Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:27.247548647Z"}
{"id":"a871ffb4-1877-45e5-a804-d77d90f04e46","expr":"!type.isInterface()","rationale":"An interface type cannot have a constructor invoked, so type is not an interface.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_constructor(Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:27.247548647Z"}
