{"id":"1be81db1-7baf-4588-8b82-d9e9ab92d0c8","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method calls type.getInternalName(), so type must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#emit_invoke(int,Type,Signature,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:31.905055359Z"}
{"id":"49ccbfb1-ed5d-4fbf-8a59-51f846fd87dd","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The owner Type must be non-null because it identifies the interface on which the method is invoked.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_interface(Type,Signature):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:36.097279225Z"}
{"id":"a1e81191-f3f4-4266-acaa-0143757bb966","expr":"sig != null","rationale":"The Signature must be non-null to specify the method being invoked on the interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#invoke_interface(Type,Signature):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:28:36.097279225Z"}
