{"id":"a8967410-57f4-44e6-8ff2-7472f32fa38b","expr":"callback.getClass() != null","rationale":"Every non-null object has a non-null Class object returned by getClass().","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:04.710425149Z"}
{"id":"6a6f4070-73fa-4ba6-a7a5-0f2020d2475d","expr":"(callback != null) && (callback.getClass() != null)","rationale":"Safe navigation: callback non-null implies getClass() returns non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:04.710425149Z"}
{"id":"17270e11-4929-4af3-ace1-05a6e775572c","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"The method calls isAssignableFrom on info.cls with callbackType, so callbackType must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:04.718273764Z"}
{"id":"847e8d48-178e-434c-a108-10b60d0a0c48","expr":"callbackType.isInterface() || !callbackType.isArray()","rationale":"A callback type generally represents a class or interface type, not an array type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:04.718273764Z"}
{"id":"7f048ea1-bcd0-4ce3-bd39-9c7896382e3b","expr":"!checkAll || callbackType != null","rationale":"If checkAll is true, callbackType must be non-null to proceed with assignments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:04.718273764Z"}
{"id":"85d87d74-4afb-4eaa-bc3f-45ea99975b5f","expr":"checkAll || true","rationale":"checkAll is a boolean so it is either true or false (trivial but valid).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:04.718273764Z"}
{"id":"242c8003-4902-4b0f-8b79-8765aa68ee10","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Because if no assignable type is found, an exception is thrown, so result is always assigned a non-null Type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:04.725829466Z"}
{"id":"1e8e383a-96aa-4f06-bc5a-4c40786c147b","expr":"!checkAll || result != null","rationale":"If !checkAll is true, early return occurs; but result is always non-null if return occurs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:04.725829466Z"}
{"id":"2fec32e3-3253-4c85-ba00-938b64fc2322","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a newly allocated array, so result is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:05.708017450Z"}
{"id":"2afc9635-c7f4-4329-9372-74f046082cc4","expr":"result.length == (callbackTypes == null ? 0 : callbackTypes.length)","rationale":"The returned array length matches the input callbackTypes array length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:05.708017450Z"}
{"id":"5fad5076-4d13-4655-8968-dcc6243c85fe","expr":"!checkAll || (result.length == (callbackTypes == null ? 0 : callbackTypes.length))","rationale":"checkAll parameter does not affect length mismatch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:05.708017450Z"}
{"id":"27d8de62-5960-4835-b2d9-34dfddae5653","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The FastClass created by generator create method should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.305074409Z"}
{"id":"0e977482-93a9-49f4-bccf-f38c09e68190","expr":"result.getJavaClass() == type","rationale":"The FastClass result should correspond to the Class type passed in.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.305074409Z"}
{"id":"0c9e3780-3f92-4414-b68e-e221ecfea959","expr":"result.getClass().getClassLoader() == ci.c2.getClassLoader()","rationale":"The FastClass instance is created with a class loader matching ci.c2's class loader.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.305074409Z"}
{"id":"e24a60a5-8e75-4bed-b61d-7bdb30f66491","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The code generation requires a non-null ClassEmitter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.310912632Z"}
{"id":"3628855b-253b-40da-aa00-20d8d65336c7","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Code generation depends on a valid context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.310912632Z"}
{"id":"3bc4461b-08ec-4c04-8ee0-3374b420e24a","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The method implementation list must be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.310912632Z"}
{"id":"d2606ae9-885b-46bf-876f-62f746acf073","expr":"!methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, code generation implies methods are available.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.310912632Z"}
{"id":"5455c125-b811-49e3-a39e-f901ac5a9f4d","expr":"methods.iterator() != null","rationale":"Having a valid iterator for methods is required before entering the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.310912632Z"}
{"id":"bb7d0eb9-e357-4d71-8cc1-e00cda709fbd","expr":"methods != null && !methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The generate method iterates over methods, so methods list is expected to be non-null and typically non-empty for effective code generation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.316686223Z"}
{"id":"ca304886-bbd9-4f7c-8273-de23df81d762","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The ClassEmitter should be non-null to declare fields and generate methods as the method implements code generation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.316686223Z"}
{"id":"a3002274-b6f2-46b0-a231-45adde1e89c8","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The context is used extensively to get implementation signature, begin method generation and emit callbacks, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.316686223Z"}
{"id":"825ca189-842f-4c06-87a6-1d9f5cbd3723","expr":"!methods.isEmpty() || ce.getName() != null","rationale":"If methods list is empty (unusual but possible), ClassEmitter should have a valid name to ensure the class context exists.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.316686223Z"}
{"id":"1ecea438-e61e-4a72-a45d-a8e7c7c97c4c","expr":"e != null","rationale":"CodeEmitter e is used as an object reference to invoke methods inside the method body, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.322027258Z"}
{"id":"32675c57-87ac-4d01-be33-6a67f87a5a7d","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context context is utilized for method calls like context.getImplSignature(...) hence must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.322027258Z"}
{"id":"5c94311d-1bbf-4cba-93da-045715285af8","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The methods list is iterated over; it must be non-null to prevent NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.322027258Z"}
{"id":"20baa170-4a24-4972-aff4-e4047a1300d0","expr":"methods.isEmpty() || methods.iterator().hasNext()","rationale":"If methods is not empty, its iterator must have elements to process in the method body.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.322027258Z"}
{"id":"250294f2-07c0-42c6-96e7-d1c7cceeec12","expr":"methods != null && context != null && e != null && !methods.isEmpty() || methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The methods list and context and code emitter e must be non-null for this method to execute; it iterates over methods which may be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.327572568Z"}
{"id":"f3977424-fc14-48be-a937-a24439ebc463","expr":"!methods.isEmpty() || true","rationale":"The method processes the methods list only if not empty; otherwise the method completes without processing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:06.327572568Z"}
{"id":"2ee3c0f9-5f89-4f42-ac7b-845219c18baa","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"getGenerator expects a non-null Type to match against the known CALLBACKS array","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:07.914978014Z"}
{"id":"d9abd55d-3251-4bac-9f79-bf2ed0609c8a","expr":"!callbackType.getClass().isPrimitive()","rationale":"callbackType is a Type, which is a non-primitive Java type","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:07.914978014Z"}
{"id":"7ee8ddaf-0a16-4fb6-a886-f2f7a4758663","expr":"callbackType.getSort() >= 0","rationale":"callbackType represents a type with a valid sort value","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:07.914978014Z"}
{"id":"262efb9b-255e-4d9b-95c9-957c9d69b3f7","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a Type object from determineType(Class, boolean), which likely never returns null, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:08.599767555Z"}
{"id":"7d5d1682-d948-4001-8c84-26bbf96645dc","expr":"result.getClass() != null","rationale":"Any non-null object returns non-null Class from getClass(), so result is a non-null Type and thus its class is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:08.599767555Z"}
{"id":"7d05016e-d4ee-4bd0-998a-88e20705d1ae","expr":"!checkAll || result != null","rationale":"If checkAll is true, result is expected non-null; this invariant expresses that if checkAll is true, result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:08.599767555Z"}
{"id":"ca0fa161-eaeb-4cf2-9e0b-12e917631967","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns from finding a matching info, result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.502247243Z"}
{"id":"e45b99fe-3407-46d5-86ab-00c7ac398965","expr":"impl != null","rationale":"impl is a method parameter and expected to be non-null when calling getMethodField","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.589497826Z"}
{"id":"f77bca4f-5777-44b1-8a1c-89953e3a181a","expr":"impl.getName() != null","rationale":"The method uses impl.getName() to build the result string, so the name must be non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.589497826Z"}
{"id":"fa12c773-b225-4c3b-8382-85b73d10cbdc","expr":"impl.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Method names typically are non-empty; empty names would be unusual and generally invalid","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.589497826Z"}
{"id":"6f800e26-9bdd-47ee-bc69-ae6f495b470a","expr":"!impl.getName().contains(\"$\")","rationale":"Because the method appends \"$Method\", this invariant ensures no name clashes","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.589497826Z"}
{"id":"d7b18097-30a8-46ee-956f-dfefdcd1b429","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The ClassEmitter parameter 'ce' is essential for code generation to proceed and thus should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.605437594Z"}
{"id":"67fc65c7-008f-4803-a927-13f6d52bf3eb","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The Context parameter provides necessary contextual information for method generation and should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.605437594Z"}
{"id":"a731c0a4-4a19-4490-abd9-30241e15a025","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The 'methods' list must be defined so the method implementation can iterate and generate code for them.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.605437594Z"}
{"id":"f661a98c-da82-42c7-b45d-19d9f17f38e1","expr":"!methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"If there were no methods, the generation would be trivial or skipped, so typically 'methods' contain some entries.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.605437594Z"}
{"id":"35e57b83-a3cf-477e-a76e-f298426a38a8","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The method likely requires a valid ClassEmitter to generate bytecode; therefore, ce should be non-null at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.620996203Z"}
{"id":"2e508c03-f613-4804-9c08-b7fa39068450","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The Context object is used to obtain implementation signatures and method indexes, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.620996203Z"}
{"id":"99bce8b9-aed4-4b12-b7b5-0e2f82cb15a7","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The method iterates over the methods list; consequently, the list must be defined at the exit point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.620996203Z"}
{"id":"01499038-5a0c-40e7-a94b-98d8d1b742fd","expr":"methods.size() >= 0","rationale":"Regardless of content, a list has a non-negative size. This invariant states that the collection is a valid list.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:09.620996203Z"}
{"id":"0dad8352-d7fb-4468-ba98-5d218ec38765","expr":"method != null && e != null && context != null","rationale":"Parameters are expected to be non-null to safely proceed with bytecode emission.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#superHelper(CodeEmitter,MethodInfo,Context):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:10.640095965Z"}
{"id":"27214c60-653d-4726-ae7e-24f76a49f224","expr":"impl != null","rationale":"The method uses impl.getName() safely, implying impl must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:12.083066739Z"}
{"id":"f8f0befd-1b13-4757-8952-bbf21bffe977","expr":"impl.getName() != null","rationale":"The method concatenates impl.getName() with a string, indicating impl.getName() is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:12.083066739Z"}
{"id":"88387ff1-377b-4fd5-88b6-be7fbe4eded7","expr":"impl.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Method names are expected to be non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:12.083066739Z"}
{"id":"1761dd11-4d7c-4d4f-bc86-98aa0a74fc41","expr":"!impl.getName().contains(\"$\")","rationale":"By convention, original method names don't contain '$' to avoid collision with proxy field suffix.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:12.083066739Z"}
{"id":"dcdfe1b0-5c0d-4969-b037-a462c1b03621","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context must be non-null for method body to function correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:12.099274472Z"}
{"id":"f4f537b7-faf4-4fd5-ab0c-ab9ee48d4e70","expr":"!methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method accesses elements from the list, so empty list would cause exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:12.099274472Z"}
{"id":"32db917b-2313-4501-ace0-b6ddadcf8a5d","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The 'methods' parameter is used throughout the method and should not be null at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:12.114816950Z"}
{"id":"06c8caa7-f2dd-4596-9ce9-883cf8947d8a","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The 'context' parameter is used to obtain method signatures and should not be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:30:12.114816950Z"}
