{"id":"e665e45f-7e3d-4ff0-a7fd-075ee4d35f82","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"The owner is expected to be the internal name of the class that owns the field; it cannot be null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:32:11.860846998Z"}
