{"id":"265b350e-41fb-490d-aec0-02a39b984790","expr":"(type == null) || (!type.isEmpty())","rationale":"If type is not null, it should be a valid non-empty string representing the exception type caught.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:32:52.191370480Z"}
