{"id":"7fc49f93-7a73-4a1f-8ebb-5d924d179dff","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"The index of a local variable must be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:32:55.529137557Z"}
