{"id":"2ba364c6-b7cb-493c-be09-fe14491c6447","expr":"(result != null) == visible","rationale":"If visible is true, the returned visitor for the visible annotation is not null, otherwise the visitor for invisible annotation is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:32:55.557001945Z"}
