{"id":"ae218e17-05b7-4f32-9ca0-671a16210ee4","expr":"start != null && start.bytecodeOffset >= 0","rationale":"start must be non-null and its bytecodeOffset must be non-negative because it represents a position in bytecode.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:32:57.990897356Z"}
