{"id":"6dff54aa-c65e-497c-82f7-f25b5e8bbdae","expr":"start.bytecodeOffset != -1","rationale":"The bytecodeOffset of the 'start' label is expected to be initialized and not -1 (unvisited).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:01.215341381Z"}
{"id":"43909651-a8b0-4bfa-8afd-f425e184d32a","expr":"maxStack >= 0","rationale":"maxStack represents the maximum stack height for a method, which cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:02.622303426Z"}
{"id":"3b7a10bf-ad92-4481-a137-0a1dc154e7db","expr":"maxLocals >= 0","rationale":"maxLocals is the maximum number of local variables, which cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:02.622303426Z"}
{"id":"680d8ac4-68ad-48d1-adc9-c93a1a49b8c8","expr":"maxStack <= 65535","rationale":"The JVM spec limits max stack size to a 16-bit unsigned value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:02.622303426Z"}
