{"id":"febedebe-3abc-4a87-85a0-bc2927f896c1","expr":"!nestHost.isEmpty()","rationale":"Since nestHost represents a JVM internal class name, it should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:38.726840145Z"}
