{"id":"70c0d597-235a-40a7-a741-70dd00ae1aa6","expr":"(name != null) || (descriptor == null)","rationale":"Per JVM specification, name and descriptor are either both null or both non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:40.727549921Z"}
