{"id":"6cb7aec7-fef4-4799-b0fe-bc7e8a0f58c6","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor of an annotation class should be a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:42.377979704Z"}
