{"id":"1e3f1012-eaa7-4a67-83c8-38e9995bf832","expr":"nestMember == null || (nestMember.trim().length() > 0)","rationale":"nestMember should be a non-empty string if not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:45.709867131Z"}
{"id":"a07878bb-1734-43f6-93f2-a7fc84b30177","expr":"nestMember != null","rationale":"The method parameter nestMember represents the internal name of a nest member, which must be a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:46.548601673Z"}
