{"id":"b218cb92-779c-4dcf-8f67-bbcfe26ece40","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"The method name is always a non-null string for a valid Method object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:53.874674487Z"}
{"id":"f921cc96-cfd7-4b44-89d2-3b32611a375b","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"The method parameter count is always zero or a positive integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:53.874674487Z"}
{"id":"1915e480-6244-4111-8f81-5d4f07fef6a5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The getType method always returns a non-null Type instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:53.901739718Z"}
{"id":"243c50df-c3f6-489c-a4af-507ac1cf5985","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Method name is mandatory and should not be null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:54.126541854Z"}
