{"id":"e6ded81f-24a1-4eeb-a178-0475c22bb933","expr":"(access & 0x1) == 0 || (access & 0x2) == 0 || (access & 0x4) == 0","rationale":"access is a bitmask of access flags that specify properties of the method","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:54.126541854Z"}
{"id":"641f2ce0-e069-471d-8d08-d28dce59c0f4","expr":"typeDescriptor != null","rationale":"The method getType expects a non-null typeDescriptor string representing a type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:56.974236076Z"}
{"id":"b90aa6d4-0a7a-4fc6-8a6d-40467411593b","expr":"typeDescriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"A type descriptor string must have at least one character representing the type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:56.974236076Z"}
{"id":"f86ea675-9a89-42e6-85e4-a22667ea680b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method documentation and behavior indicate that it returns a Type instance corresponding to the input descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:59.205525108Z"}
{"id":"21bee9c3-5a95-41d0-8b12-17cfff4d7b2d","expr":"result.getDescriptor().equals(typeDescriptor)","rationale":"The method contracts and typical behavior imply the returned Type corresponds to the given descriptor accurately.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:59.205525108Z"}
{"id":"793ace75-f91b-41fd-8054-293a1f46487d","expr":"result.getSort() >= 0 && result.getSort() <= 14","rationale":"The sort of the returned Type should be valid within the known ASM type categories.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:59.205525108Z"}
{"id":"7a3ee185-40f7-4bc9-8a9b-716aa2999eb6","expr":"result.getClassName() != null && !result.getClassName().isEmpty()","rationale":"Ensuring the returned Type has a meaningful class name is a good invariant to confirm correctness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:33:59.205525108Z"}
