{"id":"25073a1c-7e8f-4eb2-acf0-deccde10f1a5","expr":"opcode != 0 || opcode == 0","rationale":"Avoid trivial or tautological invariants; included here only for example and will be filtered in real generation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:16.772824859Z"}
