{"id":"7518dbb7-3f83-4e5c-9474-2a831075ff61","expr":"parameterCount <= 255","rationale":"The method parameter count is most probably limited by the bytecode format to the range 0-255.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotableParameterCount(int,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:21.991748131Z"}
{"id":"e754fc05-eef6-48d1-b787-49d5c1691eb0","expr":"parameterCount == 0 || parameterCount > 0","rationale":"parameterCount is a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotableParameterCount(int,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:21.991748131Z"}
