{"id":"cee55374-fc14-4555-a951-e88f349842bc","expr":"local != null || numLocal == 0","rationale":"If numLocal > 0, local array should be non-null to represent locals","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:24.888643400Z"}
{"id":"ac4418d8-81d6-40f0-8cab-11b4fb7b6b86","expr":"stack != null || numStack == 0","rationale":"If numStack > 0, stack array should be non-null to represent the operand stack","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:24.888643400Z"}
{"id":"b347ee3c-a61f-473b-ae97-a166eb7b3f98","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"ASM opcodes are unsigned byte values, so the opcode must be in 0 to 255 inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:26.088110642Z"}
{"id":"c4b013fb-e53f-4925-b814-ffca4989bb75","expr":"varIndex >= 0","rationale":"Variable indices used in bytecode instructions cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:26.088110642Z"}
{"id":"add43e50-5d74-48d8-b481-de44814676f4","expr":"opcode != -1","rationale":"Opcode should never be -1 because it is derived from an unsigned byte.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:26.088110642Z"}
