{"id":"fa401e9e-450d-4637-8719-606d28799357","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The owner string identifies the internal name of the field's owner class; it must be non-null to refer to a valid class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:27.213085848Z"}
