{"id":"ae23d045-fe95-4db7-82d1-ac88d3205572","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The owner string specifies the internal name of the method's owner class and should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:29.653047753Z"}
{"id":"03eaed95-4efc-4a56-b7f6-5a17a477696a","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method name cannot be null as it identifies the method being called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:29.653047753Z"}
{"id":"94fa6e3b-fe35-45dd-a62c-b63bb2b6790f","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor specifies the method signature and cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:29.653047753Z"}
{"id":"5bc955e6-6e6c-4d62-a6c0-0be75b69d179","expr":"opcode == 182 || opcode == 183 || opcode == 184 || opcode == 185","rationale":"The opcode indicates the type of method invocation: INVOKEVIRTUAL (182), INVOKESPECIAL (183), INVOKESTATIC (184), or INVOKEINTERFACE (185).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:29.653047753Z"}
{"id":"f06615c2-ddfa-42f9-a086-b9a414e4b4d9","expr":"opcode != 0","rationale":"The opcode cannot be zero as zero is not a valid method invocation opcode.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:29.653047753Z"}
{"id":"da325791-171a-4754-9abd-d5e9bccd47b7","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name parameter must be a valid method name string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:32.138092088Z"}
