{"id":"de3c5cf5-c288-42fc-9b21-ac1ddf424fed","expr":"label.getOffset() >= 0","rationale":"The label represents a position in bytecode; offsets are non-negative indexes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:39.465407117Z"}
{"id":"ec66ca00-ae71-4208-9a7b-ad7cc4150952","expr":"varIndex >= 0","rationale":"Local variable indices in JVM bytecode are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:41.084932805Z"}
