{"id":"399b8682-3794-42bc-8be0-5359d1f53b81","expr":"labels.length == (max - min + 1)","rationale":"The length of the labels array matches the number of possible key values from min to max.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:43.031819802Z"}
