{"id":"b538d2cb-5280-4ab5-9698-b048213dbb57","expr":"descriptor.length() >= numDimensions + 1","rationale":"The descriptor length must be enough to express the array type with requested dimensions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:47.019738513Z"}
{"id":"244ca52e-9a0b-4b63-b2b7-42c3947e1d6b","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"Ensures that the descriptor string is not null, which is necessary to safely call mv.visitMultiANewArrayInsn.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:49.358726158Z"}
{"id":"4eecd2bc-3d35-4594-88e8-f7a950efaeee","expr":"numDimensions > 0","rationale":"The number of dimensions requested should be at least one for a valid multi-dimensional array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:49.358726158Z"}
{"id":"60044875-fd70-4b9c-8800-25d8a6a79eec","expr":"descriptor.length() >= 2","rationale":"Descriptor length is at least 2, consistent with valid array type descriptor format.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:49.358726158Z"}
{"id":"9a8d3743-f14a-4cb5-9a2d-4be95c754d58","expr":"numDimensions <= descriptor.lastIndexOf('[') + 1","rationale":"Ensures that the number of dimensions to allocate doesn't exceed the dimensions encoded in the descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:49.358726158Z"}
{"id":"012f35c4-57e3-4680-bb07-734d29cc07e0","expr":"!descriptor.isEmpty() && descriptor.charAt(0) == '['","rationale":"Ensures the descriptor string starts with '[' as expected for array descriptors.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:49.358726158Z"}
{"id":"81f7f506-aaf0-49b4-9c17-90dd22383fb9","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor string represents the annotation class descriptor and is expected to be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:49.460836230Z"}
{"id":"04a13300-f6bd-4a56-b1f1-ebc88a32b1e6","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"When typePath is not null, its length should be non-negative representing a valid path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:49.460836230Z"}
{"id":"71eee046-c176-44c5-8070-d796baa09a2e","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"The 'visible' parameter is a boolean indicating visibility, so must be either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:49.460836230Z"}
{"id":"aff9ac03-2a83-4eb8-aecc-d2dd547badf7","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start label represents the beginning of the exception handler's scope; it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T16:40:50.802297008Z"}
